ore pleasant printing experience, even in enclosed workspaces.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Broad Compatibility</strong><span> </span>ELEGOO Water-Washable Resin V2.0 is compatible with a wide range of 3D printers, including:<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mars, Saturn, Jupiter Series,<span> </span></strong><strong>Anycubic Photon Mono, M3, M5 Series,<span> </span></strong><strong>Phrozen Series,<span> </span></strong><strong>Creality Series and<span> </span></strong><strong>Other LCD, MSLA, and DLP printers using 405nm UV wavelength<br></strong><br></p>	1799.00	1799.00	1799.00	14	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443875009-332119550.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443875021-128968985.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443874987-186512522.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443875052-3164479.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443877568-87252057.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443878284-337574258.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443878590-673575999.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443878891-829110286.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443879694-363552588.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "