ta-end="947">\n<p data-start="867" data-end="947"><strong data-start="867" data-end="883">Fast Curing:</strong> Optimized for efficient printing with shorter exposure times.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="948" data-end="1034">\n<p data-start="950" data-end="1034"><strong data-start="950" data-end="973">Wide Compatibility:</strong> Works seamlessly with most LCD/DLP 3D printers (405nm UV).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start="1036" data-end="1060"><strong data-start="1041" data-end="1058">Applications:</strong></h4>\n<ul data-start="1061" data-end="1229">\n<li data-start="1061" data-end="1102">\n<p data-start="1063" data-end="1102">Engineering and functional prototypes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1103" data-end="1140">\n<p data-start="1105" data-end="1140">Miniatures, models, and figurines</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1141" data-end="1191">\n<p data-start="1143" data-end="1191">Durable parts requiring strength and precision</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1192" data-end="1229">\n<p data-start="1194" data-end="1229">Educational and research projects</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start="1231" data-end="1250"><strong data-start="1236" data-end="1248">Caution:</strong></h4>\n<ul data-start="1251" data-end="1425">\n<li data-start="1251" data-end="1277">\n<p data-start="1253" data-end="1277">Shake well before use.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1278" data-end="1320">\n<p data-start="1280" data-end="1320">Wear gloves and a mask while handling.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1321" data-end="1378">\n<p data-start="1323" data-end="1378">Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1379" data-end="1425">\n<p data-start="1381" data-end="1425">Post-cure under UV light for best results.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>	<h3 data-start="115" data-end="175"><strong data-start="119" data-end="173">3D Galaxy ABS-Like UV Sensitive Resin – Gray (1kg)</strong></h3>\n<p data-start="177" data-end="494">Achieve exceptional print quality and durability with <strong data-start="231" data-e