1d8055 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="51d8055" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0f43d16 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0f43d16" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9c8cd83 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="9c8cd83" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="511" height="383" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153555/jupiter-2-1.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69548" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0e9fef0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0e9fef0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-35c4467 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="35c4467" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="511" height="383" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153600/8.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69550" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0f0cc03 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="0f0cc03" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6685935 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="6685935" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="510" height="123" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14155124/last-image-scaled.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69553" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n</div>	<p><span>The world of large-format resin 3D printing is entering a new era, and the launch of </span><strong data-start="672" data-end="788">Elegoo Debuts Jupiter 2 Large-Format Resin 3D Printer for Bigger Ideas and Smarter Engineering at RAPID+TCT 2025</strong><span> marks a significant step forward for both professionals and passionate creators<br>The <strong data-start="1202" data-end="1318">Elegoo Debuts Jupiter 2 Large-Format Resin 3D Printer for Bigger Ideas and Smarter Engineering at RAPID+TCT 2025</strong> introduces an entirely upgraded approach to high-volume resin printing. This model is more than an incremental improvement—it reflects a new design philosophy focused on accessibility, consistency, and smarter engineering. Built for users who require a large build area, precision detailing, and reliable long-term performance, the Jupiter 2 stands as Elegoo’s most advanced resin printer to date.</span><br></p>\n<h2 data-start="1718" data-end="1771"><strong data-start="1721" data-end="1771">A New Benchmark in Large-Format Resin Printing</strong></h2>\n<p data-start="1773" data-end="2349">Unveiled at the prestigious Rapid + TCT 2025 event in Detroit, the<span> </span><strong data-start="1840" data-end="1956">Elegoo Debuts Jupiter 2 Large-Format Resin 3D Printer for Bigger Ideas and Smarter Engineering at RAPID+TCT 2025</strong><span> </span>instantly captured the attention of engineers, product designers, prop makers, and manufacturing professionals. With a massive<span> </span><strong data-start="2084" data-end="2112">302.40 × 161.98 × 300 mm</strong><span> </span>build volume, it is now the largest resin printer in the entire Elegoo lineup—ideal for large prototypes, medical models, engineering components, hobby builds, and intricate display pieces that demand size without compromising accuracy.</p>\n<p data-start="2351" data-end="2646">The system features an ultra-high-resolution<span> </span><strong data-start="2396" data-end="2426">14-inch 16K monochrome LCD</strong>, delivering crisp details with an impressive<span> </span><strong data-start="2472" data-end="2500">20 × 26 µm XY resolution</strong>. The result? Razor-sharp models with beautifully smooth surfaces, making the printer suitable for applications where precision is non-negotiable.</p>\n<p data-start="2648" data-end="2934">Elegoo has also introduced a<span> </span><strong data-start="2677" data-end="2708">fully enclosed light engine</strong>, designed to deliver evenly distributed curing, reducing model defects and enhancing layer uniformity. Whether you’re printing functional parts or artistic creations, the Jupiter 2 ensures premium output right out of the box.<br></p>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-61e25991 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="61e25991" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-405efc8f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="405efc8f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<h3 data-section-id="u0ybrq" data-start="1503" data-end="1517">Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id="846b68" data-start="1519" data-end="1556">\n<strong>Ultra-High 16K Printing Precision:</strong><span> </span>The 14-inch 16K LCD screen delivers ultra-high resolution and exceptional detail. As a result, users can produce highly detailed models with smooth surfaces, which makes the printer ideal for professional applications.</li>\n<li data-section-id="co316l" data-start="1785" data-end="1822">\n<strong>Massive Large-Format Build Volume</strong>: The large 302.4 × 161.98 × 300 mm build area allows users to print large models effortlessly. Additionally, users can print multiple parts simultaneously, which significantly increases production efficiency.</li>\n<li data-section-id="18qd9c9" data-start="2040" data-end="2073">\n<strong>Auto-Leveling System:</strong><span> </span>The multi-point automatic bed leveling system calibrates the build plate accurately before printing. Therefore, it ensures consistent print quality and reliable results. Moreover, users can also perform manual leveling for precise adjustments when needed.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1u9nk85" data-start="2343" data-end="2388">\n<strong>Smart Resin Tank with Temperature Control:</strong><span> </span>The intelligent resin tank preheats the resin and maintains an optimal temperature automatically. As a result, the printer delivers stable resin flow and consistent print quality even in varying environments.</li>\n<li data-section-id="qj697i" data-start="2607" data-end="2646">\n<strong>Automatic Resin Feeding &amp; Recycling:</strong><span> </span>The smart resin management system automatically supplies resin during printing. Additionally, it recycles unused resin, which helps reduce material waste. Furthermore, the detachable resin box supports a 2KG resin bottle, making large print jobs more convenient.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1b5ed17" data-start="2923" data-end="2953">\n<strong>Quick and Easy Maintenance:</strong><span> </span>The modular design allows users to replace the LCD screen in just 10 minutes. Consequently, this reduces downtime and ensures faster maintenance.</li>\n<li data-section-id="hgahd8" data-start="3105" data-end="3144">\n<strong>Ultra-Fast Release Film Replacement:</strong><span> </span>Users can replace the release film in only 10 seconds, which is up to 10× faster than traditional systems. Therefore, maintenance becomes quicker and more efficient.</li>\n<li data-section-id="px5q9y" data-start="3320" data-end="3364">\n<strong>Built-In Camera for Real-Time Monitoring:</strong><span> </span>The integrated camera allows users to monitor prints remotely in real time. In addition, the adaptive lighting system ensures clear visibility even in low-light environments.</li>\n<li data-section-id="5mh0r3" data-start="3549" data-end="3573">\n<strong>User-Friendly Design:</strong><span> </span>The printer features a practical and user-friendly design for everyday operation. For instance, the double-door front allows easy access for removing prints, while the clear viewing window helps users monitor prints quickly. Moreover, rubberized corners provide additional protection, and the resin drip tray keeps the workspace clean.</li>\n<li data-section-id="xwcgeq" data-start="3931" data-end="3960">\n<strong>Compatible with Mars Mate:</strong><span> </span>The Elegoo Mars Mate Air Purifier works seamlessly with the Elegoo Jupiter 2 16K Resin 3D Printer. As a result, it helps reduce resin odors and creates a cleaner and more comfortable printing environment.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ce04ff e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="4ce04ff" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ab89ddd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="ab89ddd" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img decoding="async" width="510" height="209" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14134836/4.jpg-1.jpeg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69537" alt="Elegoo Jupiter 2"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1b71043 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="1b71043" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2178526 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2178526" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-52c66bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="52c66bb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img decoding="async" width="511" height="383" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153558/jupiter-1.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69549" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-05e46ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="05e46ff" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d571760 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="d571760" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img decoding="async" width="509" height="382" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153553/Untitled-design-1.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69547" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-833b4ae e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="833b4ae" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ff5af0e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="ff5af0e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6480542 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="6480542" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="511" height="383" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153551/Untitled-design-2.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69546" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e969990 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e969990" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2084c4c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="2084c4c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="511" height="383" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153548/Untitled-design.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69545" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-df0275e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="df0275e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-86a4354 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="86a4354" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-90ad624 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="90ad624" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="511" height="383" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153546/5-1.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69544" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-921e0f3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="921e0f3" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-34e5c9d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="34e5c9d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="511" height="383" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153544/6.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69543" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-51d8055 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="51d8055" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0f43d16 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0f43d16" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9c8cd83 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="9c8cd83" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="511" height="383" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153555/jupiter-2-1.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69548" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0e9fef0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0e9fef0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-35c4467 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="35c4467" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="511" height="383" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153600/8.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69550" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0f0cc03 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="0f0cc03" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6685935 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="6685935" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="510" height="123" src="https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14155124/last-image-scaled.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-69553" alt=""></div>\n</div>\n</div>	105999.00	105999.00	105999.00	5	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886429-390984445.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "keywords": [], "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	\N	2026-07-19 06:55:15.825+00	2026-08-09 04:42:57.245563+00	0.00	g
31285619-6c72-4c77-b631-c2a30f98de75	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	Anycubic Kobra X 3D Printer	anycubic-kobra-x-3d-printer	anycubic-kobra-x-3d-printer	<p>The <strong data-start="575" data-end="606">Anycubic Kobra X 3D Printer</strong> is a powerful large-format FDM 3D printer engineered for creators who need <strong data-start="682" data-end="718">size, precision, and reliability</strong> in one complete package. Designed to support everyone from <strong data-start="778" data-end="815">first-time users to professionals</strong>, the Kobra X combines intelligent automation, robust mechanics, and a generous build volume to unlock serious production potential.</p>\n<h2 data-start="1178" data-end="1210"> Bigger Ideas</h2>\n<p data-start="1212" data-end="1411">With a <strong data-start="1219" data-end="1262">massive 260 × 260 ×260 mm build volume</strong>, the Anycubic Kobra X allows you to print <strong data-start="1305" data-end="1339">large models in a single piece</strong> or produce multiple parts simultaneously. This capability is ideal for:</p>\n<p data-start="1415" data-end="1438" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Functional prototypes</p>\n<p data-start="1441" data-end="1460" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Jigs and fixtures</p>\n<p data-start="1463" data-end="1501" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Architectural and engineering models</p>\n<p data-start="1504" data-end="1526" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Educational projects</p>\n<p data-start="1529" data-end="1559" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Cosplay props and enclosures</p>\n<p data-start="1562" data-end="1592" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Small-batch production parts</p>\n<p data-start="1594" data-end="1692">No more splitting models or compromising on design size—print what you imagine, as you imagine it.</p>\n<h2 data-start="1699" data-end="1749"> Leveling – Print with Confidence</h2>\n<p data-start="1751" data-end="2019">Manual bed leveling is one of the biggest pain points in 3D printing. The Kobra X solves this with <strong data-start="1850" data-end="1907">Anycubic’s LeviQ intelligent auto bed leveling system</strong>.<br data-start="1908" data-end="1911">Using precise multi-point detection, the printer automatically compensates for bed irregularities, ensuring:</p>\n<p data-start="2023" data-end="2053" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Perfect first-layer adhesion</p>\n<p data-start="2056" data-end="2080" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Reduced print failures</p>\n<p data-start="2083" data-end="2102" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Faster setup time</p>\n<p data-start="2105" data-end="2142" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Stress-free operation for beginners</p>\n<p data-start="2144" data-end="2254">This feature alone makes the Kobra X one of the most <strong data-start="2197" data-end="2243">beginner-friendly large-format 3D printers</strong> available.</p>\n<h2 data-start="2261" data-end="2312">Direct Drive Extruder for Accuracy &amp; Flexibility</h2>\n<p data-start="2314" data-end="2504">The <strong data-start="2318" data-end="2343">direct drive extruder</strong> places the motor closer to the nozzle, giving you precise filament control and smoother extrusion. This design significantly improves performance when printing:</p>\n<p data-start="2508" data-end="2539" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Flexible materials like <strong data-start="2532" data-end="2539">TPU</strong></p>\n<p data-start="2542" data-end="2574" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Detailed models with retractions</p>\n<p data-start="2577" data-end="2604" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Functional mechanical parts</p>\n<p data-start="2606" data-end="2754">Paired with an <strong data-start="2621" data-end="2641">all-metal hotend</strong>, the printer supports high-temperature operation and maintains consistent extrusion even during long print jobs.</p>\n<h2 data-start="2761" data-end="2802"> Stability, and Silent Operation</h2>\n<p data-start="2804" data-end="2964">The Anycubic Kobra X achieves an excellent balance between <strong data-start="2863" data-end="2886">speed and precision</strong>, with print speeds of up to <strong data-start="2915" data-end="2927">100 mm/s</strong> without sacrificing surface quality.</p>\n<p data-start="2966" data-end="3112">Its <strong data-start="2970" data-end="2992">dual Z-axis system</strong> and reinforced frame enhance vertical stability, reducing wobble and layer shifts—especially important for tall prints.</p>\n<p data-start="3114" data-end="3261">A <strong data-start="3116" data-end="3168">silent motherboard and optimized stepper drivers</strong> keep noise levels low, making the printer suitable for homes, offices, labs, and classrooms.</p>\n<h2 data-start="3268" data-end="3298">Material Compatibility</h2>\n<p data-start="3300" data-end="3374">This printer supports a broad range of commonly used filaments, including:</p>\n<p data-start="3378" data-end="3420" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start="3378" data-end="3385">PLA</strong> – easy, beginner-friendly prints</p>\n<p data-start="3423" data-end="3463" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start="3423" data-end="3430">ABS</strong> – strong, heat-resistant parts</p>\n<p data-start="3466" data-end="3510" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start="3466" data-end="3474">PETG</strong> – durable and flexible components</p>\n<p data-start="3513" data-end="3558" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start="3513" data-end="3520">TPU</strong> – flexible and elastic applications</p>\n<p data-start="3560" data-end="3686">From rigid engineering parts to flexible functional components, the Kobra X adapts to diverse professional and creative needs.</p>\n<h2 data-start="3693" data-end="3745">Designed for Beginners. Trusted by Professionals.</h2>\n<p data-start="3747" data-end="3863">The Kobra X ships with <strong data-start="3770" data-end="3787">easy assembly</strong>, a <strong data-start="3791" data-end="3827">responsive touchscreen interface</strong>, and smart safety features such as:</p>\n<p data-start="3867" data-end="3895" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Filament run-out detection</p>\n<p data-start="3898" data-end="3932" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Resume printing after power loss</p>\n<p data-start="3934" data-end="4067">These features protect long prints, reduce material waste, and make the printer dependable for business and educational environments.</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-5.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946" width="459" height="459"><br><br><br><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-6.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946" width="458" height="458"></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-7_1d0acaf7-d82b-4f47-83e5-47bcb7710d39.jpg?v=1773401754&amp;width=1946" width="458" height="458"></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-8.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946" width="454" height="454"></p>	<p>The <strong data-start="575" data-end="606">Anycubic Kobra X 3D Printer</strong> is a powerful large-format FDM 3D printer engineered for creators who need <strong data-start="682" data-end="718">size, precision, and reliability</strong> in one complete package. Designed to support everyone from <strong data-start="778" data-end="815">first-time users to professionals</strong>, the Kobra X combines intelligent automation, robust mechanics, and a generous build volume to unlock serious production potential.</p>\n<h2 data-start="1178" data-end="1210"> Bigger Ideas</h2>\n<p data-start="1212" data-end="1411">With a <strong data-start="1219" data-end="1262">massive 260 × 260 ×260 mm build volume</strong>, the Anycubic Kobra X allows you to print <strong data-start="1305" data-end="1339">large models in a single piece</strong> or produce multiple parts simultaneously. This capability is ideal for:</p>\n<p data-start="1415" data-end="1438" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Functional prototypes</p>\n<p data-start="1441" data-end="1460" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Jigs and fixtures</p>\n<p data-start="1463" data-end="1501" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Architectural and engineering models</p>\n<p data-start="1504" data-end="1526" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Educational projects</p>\n<p data-start="1529" data-end="1559" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Cosplay props and enclosures</p>\n<p data-start="1562" data-end="1592" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Small-batch production parts</p>\n<p data-start="1594" data-end="1692">No more splitting models or compromising on design size—print what you imagine, as you imagine it.</p>\n<h2 data-start="1699" data-end="1749"> Leveling – Print with Confidence</h2>\n<p data-start="1751" data-end="2019">Manual bed leveling is one of the biggest pain points in 3D printing. The Kobra X solves this with <strong data-start="1850" data-end="1907">Anycubic’s LeviQ intelligent auto bed leveling system</strong>.<br data-start="1908" data-end="1911">Using precise multi-point detection, the printer automatically compensates for bed irregularities, ensuring:</p>\n<p data-start="2023" data-end="2053" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Perfect first-layer adhesion</p>\n<p data-start="2056" data-end="2080" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Reduced print failures</p>\n<p data-start="2083" data-end="2102" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Faster setup time</p>\n<p data-start="2105" data-end="2142" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Stress-free operation for beginners</p>\n<p data-start="2144" data-end="2254">This feature alone makes the Kobra X one of the most <strong data-start="2197" data-end="2243">beginner-friendly large-format 3D printers</strong> available.</p>\n<h2 data-start="2261" data-end="2312">Direct Drive Extruder for Accuracy &amp; Flexibility</h2>\n<p data-start="2314" data-end="2504">The <strong data-start="2318" data-end="2343">direct drive extruder</strong> places the motor closer to the nozzle, giving you precise filament control and smoother extrusion. This design significantly improves performance when printing:</p>\n<p data-start="2508" data-end="2539" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Flexible materials like <strong data-start="2532" data-end="2539">TPU</strong></p>\n<p data-start="2542" data-end="2574" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Detailed models with retractions</p>\n<p data-start="2577" data-end="2604" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Functional mechanical parts</p>\n<p data-start="2606" data-end="2754">Paired with an <strong data-start="2621" data-end="2641">all-metal hotend</strong>, the printer supports high-temperature operation and maintains consistent extrusion even during long print jobs.</p>\n<h2 data-start="2761" data-end="2802"> Stability, and Silent Operation</h2>\n<p data-start="2804" data-end="2964">The Anycubic Kobra X achieves an excellent balance between <strong data-start="2863" data-end="2886">speed and precision</strong>, with print speeds of up to <strong data-start="2915" data-end="2927">100 mm/s</strong> without sacrificing surface quality.</p>\n<p data-start="2966" data-end="3112">Its <strong data-start="2970" data-end="2992">dual Z-axis system</strong> and reinforced frame enhance vertical stability, reducing wobble and layer shifts—especially important for tall prints.</p>\n<p data-start="3114" data-end="3261">A <strong data-start="3116" data-end="3168">silent motherboard and optimized stepper drivers</strong> keep noise levels low, making the printer suitable for homes, offices, labs, and classrooms.</p>\n<h2 data-start="3268" data-end="3298">Material Compatibility</h2>\n<p data-start="3300" data-end="3374">This printer supports a broad range of commonly used filaments, including:</p>\n<p data-start="3378" data-end="3420" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start="3378" data-end="3385">PLA</strong> – easy, beginner-friendly prints</p>\n<p data-start="3423" data-end="3463" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start="3423" data-end="3430">ABS</strong> – strong, heat-resistant parts</p>\n<p data-start="3466" data-end="3510" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start="3466" data-end="3474">PETG</strong> – durable and flexible components</p>\n<p data-start="3513" data-end="3558" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start="3513" data-end="3520">TPU</strong> – flexible and elastic applications</p>\n<p data-start="3560" data-end="3686">From rigid engineering parts to flexible functional components, the Kobra X adapts to diverse professional and creative needs.</p>\n<h2 data-start="3693" data-end="3745">Designed for Beginners. Trusted by Professionals.</h2>\n<p data-start="3747" data-end="3863">The Kobra X ships with <strong data-start="3770" data-end="3787">easy assembly</strong>, a <strong data-start="3791" data-end="3827">responsive touchscreen interface</strong>, and smart safety features such as:</p>\n<p data-start="3867" data-end="3895" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Filament run-out detection</p>\n<p data-start="3898" data-end="3932" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">·<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Resume printing after power loss</p>\n<p data-start="3934" data-end="4067">These features protect long prints, reduce material waste, and make the printer dependable for business and educational environments.</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-5.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946" width="459" height="459"><br><br><br><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-6.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946" width="458" height="458"></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-7_1d0acaf7-d82b-4f47-83e5-47bcb7710d39.jpg?v=1773401754&amp;width=1946" width="458" height="458"></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-8.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946" width="454" height="454"></p>	40999.00	40999.00	40999.00	5	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889793-958549371.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889865-56333190.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890157-980423507.webp", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "keywords": [], "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	\N	2026-07-19 06:55:28.365+00	2026-08-01 03:19:49.596607+00	0.00	g
71e1a3e6-e985-4a37-bad2-e264d0234b0b	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	Anycubic Kobra 3 Combo 3D Printer	anycubic-kobra-3-combo-3d-printer	anycubic-kobra-3-combo-3d-printer	<h6 class="text-main fw-small">Product Features</h6>\n<p class="desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end"><span class="text-primary">•</span><span> </span>The Anycubic Kobra 3 3D Printer Combo is a cutting-edge, user-friendly machine that combines precision, speed, and versatility, making it ideal for both beginners and advanced users.</p>\n<p class="desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end"><span class="text-primary">•</span><span> </span>It boasts a spacious build volume for creating larger models or multiple prints simultaneously, and a direct drive extruder for accurate filament feeding, particularly useful for flexible filaments.</p>\n<p class="desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end"><span class="text-primary">•</span><span> </span>The high-precision auto-leveling system ensures a consistently level print bed, enhancing overall print quality. Additionally, the printer features a flexible magnetic build plate, making print removal easy and reducing the risk of damage.</p>\n<p class="desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end"><span class="text-primary">•</span><span> </span>Whats in the Box:</p>\n<p class="desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end"><span class="text-primary">•</span><span> </span>• Anycubic Kobra 3 Combo 3D Printer</p>\n<p class="desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end"><span class="text-primary">•</span><span> </span>• Power Supply and Cables</p>\n<p class="desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end"><span class="text-primary">•</span><span> </span>• Tool Kit</p>\n<p class="desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end"><span class="text-primary">•</span><span> </span>• User Manual</p>\n<p class="desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end"><span class="text-primary">•</span><span> </span>• Does not include Filaments<br><br></p>\n<main id="MainContent" class="content-for-layout focus-none" role="main" tabindex="-1">\n<div id="shopify-section-template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb" class="shopify-section section">\n<div class="page-width">\n<div class="image-with-text__text-item grid__item">\n<div id="ImageWithText--template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb" class="image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--radius image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient">\n<h2 class="image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb-heading_M7nQrt appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__heading h3 color-foreground image-with-text__heading--bold break done">Smart Multi-Color Printing</h2>\n<div class="image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb-text_WPNTKD appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__text text-sm rte body color-foreground done">\n<ul>\n<li>Unleash 4-Color Printing</li>\n<li>Print up to 8*① Stunning Colors.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section id="shopify-section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" class="shopify-section yg-image-text">\n<div class="section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj-padding color- gradient isolate">\n<div class="page-width">\n<div class="yg-heading">\n<div class="yg-section-title h3"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class="yg-section-content">\n<div class="yg-section-image hide-mobile">\n<div class="block-image-container" data-block-id="item_47dbgd"><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_3.jpg?v=1753270490" alt="ANYCUBIC-STORE" width="483" height="290" class="hide-mobile yg-image" loading="lazy"></div>\n</div>\n<div class="yg-question-box grid grid--1-col collapsible-content__grid">\n<div class="grid__item">\n<details id="Details-item_47dbgd-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" data-accordion-id="item_47dbgd">\n<summary class="summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por" id="Summary-item_47dbgd-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="CollapsibleAccordion-item_47dbgd-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj"><span class="accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0">Drying while Printing</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id="Details-item_ctVb3T-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" data-accordion-id="item_ctVb3T">\n<summary class="summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por" id="Summary-item_ctVb3T-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="CollapsibleAccordion-item_ctVb3T-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj"><span class="accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0">Filament Backup</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id="Details-item_Nf9dJD-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" data-accordion-id="item_Nf9dJD">\n<summary class="summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por" id="Summary-item_Nf9dJD-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="CollapsibleAccordion-item_Nf9dJD-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj"><span class="accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0">Nozzle Clog Detection</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id="Details-item_ywt3VD-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" data-accordion-id="item_ywt3VD">\n<summary class="summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por" id="Summary-item_ywt3VD-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="CollapsibleAccordion-item_ywt3VD-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj"><span class="accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0">Filament Drying at All Times</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id="Details-item_QfLF6N-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" data-accordion-id="item_QfLF6N">\n<summary class="summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por" id="Summary-item_QfLF6N-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="CollapsibleAccordion-item_QfLF6N-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj"><span class="accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0">Optimal Storage</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id="Details-item_tDwQxK-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" data-accordion-id="item_tDwQxK">\n<summary class="summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por" id="Summary-item_tDwQxK-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="CollapsibleAccordion-item_tDwQxK-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj"><span class="accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0">Intelligent Identification Filament Sync</span></summary>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div id="shopify-section-template--18231269687458__image_with_text_qjw3Er" class="shopify-section section">\n<div class="page-width">\n<div class="image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item"><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=1500" alt="" srcset="//store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=165 165w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=360 360w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=535 535w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=700 700w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=875 875w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=1070 1070w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=1500 1500w" width="483" height="290" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 1100px, (min-width: 750px) calc(100vw * 0.67), 100vw"></div>\n<div class="image-with-text__text-item grid__item">\n<div id="ImageWithText--template--18231269687458__image_with_text_qjw3Er" class="image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--radius image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient">\n<h2 class="image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_qjw3Er-heading_iWxpbL appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__heading h3 color-foreground image-with-text__heading--bold break done">Max 600mm/s, Printing at the Pace of Though</h2>\n<div class="image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_qjw3Er-text_39rMJW appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__text text-sm rte body color-foreground done">\n<ul>\n<li>Optimized configuration, bolstered computational, and superior cooling system</li>\n<li>Complete Benchy in 11min 30s</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id="shopify-section-template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL" class="shopify-section section">\n<div class="page-width">\n<div class="image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item"><img src="https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=1500" alt="" srcset="//store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=165 165w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=360 360w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=535 535w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=700 700w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=875 875w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=1070 1070w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=1500 1500w" width="483" height="290" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 1100px, (min-width: 750px) calc(100vw * 0.67), 100vw"></div>\n<div class="image-with-text__text-item grid__item">\n<div id="ImageWithText--template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL" class="image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--radius image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient">\n<h2 class="image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL-heading_WEbtTr appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__heading h3 color-foreground image-with-text__heading--bold break done">250*250*260mm, Expansive Printing Space</h2>\n<div class="image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL-text_etNbbN appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__text text-sm rte body color-foreground done">\n<p>The Kobra 3 Combo features printing sizes up to 250 x 250 x 260mm, with a maximum printing volume of 4.29 gal (16.25L), increased by a whopping 34% compared to previous 3D printers.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section id="shopify-section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT" class="shopify-section yg-image-text">\n<div class="section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT-padding color- gradient isolate">\n<div class="page-width">\n<div class="yg-heading">\n<div cla