et_type="text-editor.default">\n<h4><span class="text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">Electro-Magnetic Air Vent</span></h4>\n<p class="text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">Automated venting facilitates dehumidification during drying and ensures airtight sealing for weeks of high-quality printing.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3a51a58 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="3a51a58" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-42a98a2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="42a98a2" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ce9c494 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="ce9c494" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<h4>Auto-rotate Drying</h4>\n<p class="text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">During the drying process, the filament spools rotate automatically to ensure more even drying </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a48d473 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="a48d473" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5052820 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="5052820" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5af033e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5af033e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<h4><span class="text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">RFID Sync</span></h4>\n<p class="text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">AMS 2 Pro uses RFID to auto-match drying settings for Bambu official filaments, no manual input needed.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-05599d9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="05599d9" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c98ca6d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c98ca6d" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">\n<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Speed Up! Faster Multi-material Printing!</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bf83587 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="bf83587" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c899b84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="c899b84" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f61e89e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="f61e89e" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-440b61e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="440b61e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">\n<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Evolved, Polished Design Detail </h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2ad5dbe e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="2ad5dbe" data-element_type="container">\n<div class