-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="ce9c494" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<h4>Auto-rotate Drying</h4>\n<p class="text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">During the drying process, the filament spools rotate automatically to ensure more even drying </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a48d473 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="a48d473" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5052820 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="5052820" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5af033e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5af033e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<h4><span class="text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">RFID Sync</span></h4>\n<p class="text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">AMS 2 Pro uses RFID to auto-match drying settings for Bambu official filaments, no manual input needed.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-05599d9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="05599d9" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c98ca6d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c98ca6d" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">\n<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Speed Up! Faster Multi-material Printing!</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bf83587 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="bf83587" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c899b84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="c899b84" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f61e89e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="f61e89e" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-440b61e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="440b61e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">\n<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Evolved, Polished Design Detail </h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2ad5dbe e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="2ad5dbe" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-08a4b8f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="08a4b8f" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b7c57b3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b7c57b3" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bb6d573 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="bb6d573" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<h4><span class="text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">Tool-Free Filament Tubes Access</span></h4>\n<p class="text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">Removing snapped filament from the first-gen AMS requires extracting all spools and disassembling the shell with two screws, taking 3-5 minutes. In contrast, the AMS 2 Pro offers direct, tool-free access to filament tubes from the top.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5694515 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="5694515" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a5eb20a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="a5eb20a" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c285c26 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="c285c26" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4185de2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4185de2" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<h4><span class="text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">Ceramic Inlet</span></h4>\n<p class="text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]">Ceramic filament inlets with Vickers hardness of 1200 significantly enhances durability.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bf4560f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="bf4560f" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c19d143 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c19d143" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">\n<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Compatible With All Bambu Lab Printers</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7b1fc84 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="7b1fc84" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-79b87b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="79b87b7" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<h5>The AMS 2 Pro will be compatible with all Bambu Lab products.</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-47aa477 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="47aa477" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6276c12 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="6276c12" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9475f6e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="9475f6e" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bc9290d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="bc9290d" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">\n<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">What’s in the Box</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-946148f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded" data-id="946148f" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cd74a24 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="cd74a24" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-eda2500 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="eda2500" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">\n<h4 class="wp-caption">Bambu AMS 2 Pro</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3a8cfa4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="3a8cfa4" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">\n<figure class="wp-caption">\n<figcaption class="widget-image-caption wp-caption-text">Desiccant</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1b8e1ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="1b8e1ac" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">\n<figure class="wp-caption">\n<figcaption class="widget-image-caption wp-caption-text">PTFE Tube (185mm*2+225mm*2+900mm*1)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0f642e0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0f642e0" data-element_type="container">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-362c9b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="362c9b3" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">\n<figure class="wp-caption">\n<figcaption class="widget-image-caption wp-caption-text">\n<h4>Bambu Bus Cable-6Pin</h4>\n<div class="widget-accordion wd-product-descriptions">\n<h2 role="button" aria-controls="feature" aria-expanded="true" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#feature" class="accordion-title">\n<span>Features</span><span class="icon icon-arrow-down"></span>\n</h2>\n<div class="collapse show" id="feature">\n<div class="accordion-body widget-desc">\n<div class="item">\n<ul class="item">\n<li>X1 Series and P1 Series are compatible with AMS 2 Pro.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class="item">\n<ul class="item">\n<li>The AMS 2 Pro is compatible with X1/P1 series printers for multi-material printing.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class="item">\n<ul class="item">\n<li>Up to 24-color/Multi-material Printing</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class="item">\n<ul class="item">\n<li>AMS 2 Pro compatibility with A1/A1 mini printers will be added through an OTA update in Q3 2025.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="widget-accordion wd-product-descriptions">\n<h2 role="button" aria-controls="description" aria-expanded="true" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#description" class="accordion-title">\n<span>Descriptions</span><span class="icon icon-arrow-down"></span>\n</h2>\n<div class="collapse show" id="description">\n<div class="accordion-body widget-material">\n<div class="item">\n<ul class="item">\n<li>Active Air Vent 65°C Filament Drying Air-tight Filament Storage Up to 24-color/Multi-material Printing Brushless Servo Feeding Motor RFID Filament Sync AMS 2 Pro compatibility with A1/A1 mini printers will be added through an OTA update in Q3 2025.</li>\n<li>The AMS 2 Pro is compatible with X1/P1 series printers for multi-material printing.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="widget-accordion wd-product-descriptions">\n<h2 role="button" aria-controls="specification" aria-expanded="true" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#specification" class="accordion-title">\n<span>Specifications</span><span class="icon icon-arrow-down"></span>\n</h2>\n<div class="collapse show" id="specification">\n<div class="accordion-body widget-material">\n<div class="item">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Dimensions :</b><span> </span>372*280*226 mm³</li>\n<li>\n<b>Net Weight :</b><span> </span>2.5 kg</li>\n<li>\n<b>Housing Material :</b><span> </span>ABS/PC</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Supported :</b><span> </span>PLA, PETG, Support for PLA/PETG, ABS*, ASA*, PET*, PA*, PC*, PVA*, BVOH *, PP, POM*, HIPS*, Bambu PLA-CF*/ PAHT-CF*/ PETG-CF*, and TPU for AMS*</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Not Supported :</b><span> </span>TPE, generic TPU, PVA (damp), BVOH (damp),Bambu PET-CF/TPU 95A, and other filament that contains carbon fiber or glass fiber</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Diameter :</b><span> </span>1.75 mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Spool Dimension :</b><span> </span>Width</li>\n<li>\n<b>RFID Identification :</b><span> </span>Supported</li>\n<li>\n<b>Highest Temperature :</b><span> </span>65 °C</li>\n<li>\n<b>Active Moisture Discharge :</b><span> </span>Supported</li>\n<li>\n<b>Sealed :</b><span> </span>Storage Supported</li>\n<li>\n<b>Temperature &amp; Humidity Detection :</b><span> </span>Supported. Real-time temperature and humidity can be displayed on the screen, Bambu Studio, and Bambu Handy.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Input :</b><span> </span>24 V 4 A</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br></figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>	45999.00	45999.00	45999.00	5	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443911169-879132475.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443911184-51306912.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "keywords": [], "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	\N	2026-07-19 06:56:20.703+00	2026-08-01 03:28:34.223233+00	0.00	g
75023a71-e4da-44a1-9598-ff8df2c71b1f	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	55a711ea-3f62-443b-9b00-dc8d361e5cac	Anycubic ACE Pro for Kobra S1 3D Printer	anycubic-ace-pro-for-kobra-s1-3d-printer	anycubic-ace-pro-for-kobra-s1-3d-printer	<h1 data-start="144" data-end="192"><strong data-start="146" data-end="192">ACE Pro for Kobra S1 – Product Description</strong></h1>\n<p data-start="194" data-end="561">The <strong data-start="198" data-end="209">ACE Pro</strong> is an advanced multi-color and multi-material filament engine designed to upgrade the <strong data-start="296" data-end="308">Kobra S1</strong> into a powerful, high-performance multi-filament 3D printing system. With intelligent material handling, active drying, and precise color switching, the ACE Pro enhances speed, reliability, and creative capability for both hobby and professional users.</p>\n<hr data-start="563" data-end="566">\n<h2 data-start="568" data-end="589"><strong data-start="571" data-end="589">✨ Key Features</strong></h2>\n<h3 data-start="591" data-end="635"><strong data-start="595" data-end="635">Multi-Color, Multi-Material Printing</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="636" data-end="832">\n<li data-start="636" data-end="690">\n<p data-start="638" data-end="690">Supports <strong data-start="647" data-end="674">up to 4 filament inputs</strong> in one print.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="691" data-end="751">\n<p data-start="693" data-end="751">Enables smooth transitions between colors and materials.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="752" data-end="832">\n<p data-start="754" data-end="832">Ideal for models with gradients, patterns, or multi-material functional parts.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="834" data-end="871"><strong data-start="838" data-end="871">Active Filament Drying System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="872" data-end="1096">\n<li data-start="872" data-end="944">\n<p data-start="874" data-end="944">Built-in heating maintains optimal filament dryness during printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="945" data-end="1033">\n<p data-start="947" data-end="1033">Prevents moisture-related issues such as stringing, bubbles, and weak layer bonding.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1034" data-end="1096">\n<p data-start="1036" data-end="1096">Ensures consistent print quality even in humid environments.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="1098" data-end="1131"><strong data-start="1102" data-end="1131">Smart Filament Management</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1132" data-end="1333">\n<li data-start="1132" data-end="1193">\n<p data-start="1134" data-end="1193">Automatic filament <strong data-start="1153" data-end="1190">loading, unloading, and switching</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1194" data-end="1249">\n<p data-start="1196" data-end="1249">Intelligent routing minimizes tangles and misfeeds.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1250" data-end="1333">\n<p data-start="1252" data-end="1333">Filament runout detection prevents failed prints by pausing and prompting reload.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="1335" data-end="1373"><strong data-start="1339" data-end="1373">High Precision Color Switching</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1374" data-end="1540">\n<li data-start="1374" data-end="1418">\n<p data-start="1376" data-end="1418">Fast, clean switching between filaments.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1419" data-end="1475">\n<p data-start="1421" data-end="1475">Reduces purging waste and improves print efficiency.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1476" data-end="1540">\n<p data-start="1478" data-end="1540">Ensures accurate color placement and crisp visual transitions.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="1542" data-end="1584"><strong data-start="1546" data-end="1584">Seamless Integration with Kobra S1</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1585" data-end="1799">\n<li data-start="1585" data-end="1648">\n<p data-start="1587" data-end="1648">Plug-and-play installation with optimized firmware support.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1649" data-end="1734">\n<p data-start="1651" data-end="1734">Works flawlessly with the Kobra S1 motion system for stable, high-speed printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1735" data-end="1799">\n<p data-start="1737" data-end="1799">Compact, efficient design that fits easily into any workspace.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start="1801" data-end="1804">\n<h2 data-start="1806" data-end="1838"><strong data-start="1809" data-end="1838">🧵 Material Compatibility</strong></h2>\n<p data-start="1839" data-end="1898">The ACE Pro supports a wide variety of materials such as:</p>\n<ul data-start="1899" data-end="2059">\n<li data-start="1899" data-end="1906">\n<p data-start="1901" data-end="1906">PLA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1907" data-end="1915">\n<p data-start="1909" data-end="1915">PETG</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1916" data-end="1923">\n<p data-start="1918" data-end="1923">TPU</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1924" data-end="1931">\n<p data-start="1926" data-end="1931">ABS</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1932" data-end="1939">\n<p data-start="1934" data-end="1939">ASA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1940" data-end="1954">\n<p data-start="1942" data-end="1954">PA (Nylon)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1955" data-end="1961">\n<p data-start="1957" data-end="1961">PC</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1962" data-end="1970">\n<p data-start="1964" data-end="1970">HIPS</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1971" data-end="2059">\n<p data-start="1973" data-end="2059">And other multi-material combinations depending on print temperature and nozzle setup.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start="2061" data-end="2064">\n<h2 data-start="2066" data-end="2094"><strong data-start="2069" data-end="2094">⚙️ Ideal Applications</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start="2095" data-end="2360">\n<li data-start="2095" data-end="2140">\n<p data-start="2097" data-end="2140">Multi-color figurines and artistic models</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2141" data-end="2188">\n<p data-start="2143" data-end="2188">Brand logos, signage, and decorative prints</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2189" data-end="2236">\n<p data-start="2191" data-end="2236">Functional prototypes with varied materials</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2237" data-end="2312">\n<p data-start="2239" data-end="2312">Engineering components requiring different properties in a single print</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2313" data-end="2360">\n<p data-start="2315" data-end="2360">Hobby projects with advanced visual effects</p>\n</li>\n</ul>	<h1 data-start="144" data-end="192"><strong data-start="146" data-end="192">ACE Pro for Kobra S1 – Product Description</strong></h1>\n<p data-start="194" data-end="561">The <strong data-start="198" data-end="209">ACE Pro</strong> is an advanced multi-color and multi-material filament engine designed to upgrade the <strong data-start="296" data-end="308">Kobra S1</strong> into a powerful, high-performance multi-filament 3D printing system. With intelligent material handling, active drying, and precise color switching, the ACE Pro enhances speed, reliability, and creative capability for both hobby and professional users.</p>\n<hr data-start="563" data-end="566">\n<h2 data-start="568" data-end="589"><strong data-start="571" data-end="589">✨ Key Features</strong></h2>\n<h3 data-start="591" data-end="635"><strong data-start="595" data-end="635">Multi-Color, Multi-Material Printing</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="636" data-end="832">\n<li data-start="636" data-end="690">\n<p data-start="638" data-end="690">Supports <strong data-start="647" data-end="674">up to 4 filament inputs</strong> in one print.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="691" data-end="751">\n<p data-start="693" data-end="751">Enables smooth transitions between colors and materials.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="752" data-end="832">\n<p data-start="754" data-end="832">Ideal for models with gradients, patterns, or multi-material functional parts.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="834" data-end="871"><strong data-start="838" data-end="871">Active Filament Drying System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="872" data-end="1096">\n<li data-start="872" data-end="944">\n<p data-start="874" data-end="944">Built-in heating maintains optimal filament dryness during printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="945" data-end="1033">\n<p data-start="947" data-end="1033">Prevents moisture-related issues such as stringing, bubbles, and weak layer bonding.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1034" data-end="1096">\n<p data-start="1036" data-end="1096">Ensures consistent print quality even in humid environments.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="1098" data-end="1131"><strong data-start="1102" data-end="1131">Smart Filament Management</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1132" data-end="1333">\n<li data-start="1132" data-end="1193">\n<p data-start="1134" data-end="1193">Automatic filament <strong data-start="1153" data-end="1190">loading, unloading, and switching</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1194" data-end="1249">\n<p data-start="1196" data-end="1249">Intelligent routing minimizes tangles and misfeeds.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1250" data-end="1333">\n<p data-start="1252" data-end="1333">Filament runout detection prevents failed prints by pausing and prompting reload.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="1335" data-end="1373"><strong data-start="1339" data-end="1373">High Precision Color Switching</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1374" data-end="1540">\n<li data-start="1374" data-end="1418">\n<p data-start="1376" data-end="1418">Fast, clean switching between filaments.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1419" data-end="1475">\n<p data-start="1421" data-end="1475">Reduces purging waste and improves print efficiency.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1476" data-end="1540">\n<p data-start="1478" data-end="1540">Ensures accurate color placement and crisp visual transitions.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="1542" data-end="1584"><strong data-start="1546" data-end="1584">Seamless Integration with Kobra S1</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1585" data-end="1799">\n<li data-start="1585" data-end="1648">\n<p data-start="1587" data-end="1648">Plug-and-play installation with optimized