m</strong> printing area.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="928" data-end="993">\n<p data-start="930" data-end="993">Ideal for large models, batch production, or multi-part prints.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="995" data-end="1028"><strong data-start="999" data-end="1028">Intelligent Auto-Leveling</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1029" data-end="1163">\n<li data-start="1029" data-end="1091">\n<p data-start="1031" data-end="1091">Equipped with <strong data-start="1045" data-end="1081">LeviQ 3.0 automatic bed leveling</strong> system.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1092" data-end="1163">\n<p data-start="1094" data-end="1163">Delivers accurate first layers and reduces manual calibration effort.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="1165" data-end="1196"><strong data-start="1169" data-end="1196">User-Friendly Operation</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1197" data-end="1302">\n<li data-start="1197" data-end="1245">\n<p data-start="1199" data-end="1245">Features a <strong data-start="1210" data-end="1242">modern touchscreen interface</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1246" data-end="1302">\n<p data-start="1248" data-end="1302">Simple navigation for beginners and experienced users.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="1304" data-end="1330"><strong data-start="1308" data-end="1330">Smart Connectivity</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1331" data-end="1421">\n<li data-start="1331" data-end="1421">\n<p data-start="1333" data-end="1421">Supports <strong data-start="1342" data-end="1393">Wi-Fi printing, mobile monitoring, USB printing</strong>, and cloud-based workflows.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start="1423" data-end="1426">\n<h2 data-start="1428" data-end="1483"><strong data-start="1431" data-end="1483">🧵 ACE Pro – Advanced Filament Management System</strong></h2>\n<p data-start="1485" data-end="1589">The <strong data-start="1489" data-end="1505">ACE Pro unit</strong> transforms the Kobra 3 into a fully capable multi-color and multi-material printer.</p>\n<h3 data-start="1591" data-end="1620"><strong data-start="1595" data-end="1620">Key ACE Pro Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start="1621" data-end="1957">\n<li data-start="1621" data-end="1678">\n<p data-start="1623" data-end="1678">Prints using <strong data-start="1636" data-end="1657">up to 4 filaments</strong> in a single model.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1679" data-end="1755">\n<p data-start="1681" data-end="1755">Active <strong data-start="1688" data-end="1714">filament drying system</strong> keeps material dry during long prints.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1756" data-end="1830">\n<p data-start="1758" data-end="1830">Intelligent <strong data-start="1770" data-end="1800">auto-feeding and unloading</strong> for seamless color changes.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1831" data-end="1898">\n<p data-start="1833" data-end="1898">Built-in sensors to detect filament runout and nozzle clogging.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1899" data-end="1957">\n<p data-start="1901" data-end="1957">Improves overall reliability and reduces print failures.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start="1959" data-end="1962">\n<h2 data-start="1964" data-end="1996"><strong data-start="1967" data-end="1996">🧩 Material Compatibility</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start="1997" data-end="2196">\n<li data-start="1997" data-end="2025">\n<p data-start="1999" data-end="2025">Standard: PLA, PETG, TPU</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2026" data-end="2084">\n<p data-start="2028" data-end="2084">With ACE Pro: ABS, ASA, PET, PA, PC, PP, HIPS and more</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2085" data-end="2196">\n<p data-start="2087" data-end="2196">Suitable for functional prototypes, decorative models, engineering parts, art pieces, and multi-color prints.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start="2198" data-end="2201">\n<h2 data-start="2203" data-end="2221"><strong data-start="2206" data-end="2221">✔ Ideal For</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start="2222" data-end="2383">\n<li data-start="2222" data-end="2249">\n<p data-start="2224" data-end="2249">3D printing enthusiasts</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2250" data-end="2285">\n<p data-start="2252" data-end="2285">Students, makers, and educators</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2286" data-end="2320">\n<p data-start="2288" data-end="2320">Designers and small businesses</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2321" data-end="2383">\n<p data-start="2323" data-end="2383">Users who want reliable <strong data-start="2347" data-end="2383">multi-color, high-speed printing</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>	24949.00	24949.00	24949.00	2	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914174-180505073.png", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443917385-752168849.png", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443917681-659797618.png", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "keywords": [], "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	\N	2026-07-19 06:56:41.836+00	2026-08-01 03:29:21.060901+00	0.00	g
