4154f59c-55bc-4714-a3e8-92f23fb2772b	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	55a711ea-3f62-443b-9b00-dc8d361e5cac	3D Galaxy Water Washable resin	3d-galaxy-water-washable-resin	3d-galaxy-water-washable-resin	<p data-end="178" data-start="80"><strong data-end="97" data-start="80">Product Name:</strong><br data-end="100" data-start="97">3D Galaxy UV Sensitive Water Washable Resin </p>\n<p data-end="595" data-start="180"><strong data-end="196" data-start="180">Description:</strong><br data-end="199" data-start="196">3D Galaxy UV Sensitive Resin is designed for high-quality 3D printing, offering precision, strength, and smooth surface finishing. This <strong data-end="361" data-start="335">water washable formula</strong> makes post-processing easy, eliminating the need for harsh chemicals or alcohol cleaning. Its <strong data-end="506" data-start="456">color-shifting Crystal Orange to Purple effect</strong> gives prints a unique aesthetic appeal while maintaining durability and functionality.</p>\n<p data-end="616" data-start="597"><strong data-end="614" data-start="597">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<p data-end="658" data-start="619"><strong data-end="632" data-start="619">Material:</strong> Water Washable UV Resin</p>\n<p data-end="717" data-start="661"><strong data-end="671" data-start="661">Color:</strong> Crystal Orange to Purple (chameleon effect)<br>           Crystal Purple to Blue <br>           Crystal Purple to Pink</p>\n<p data-end="743" data-start="720"><strong data-end="731" data-start="720">Weight:</strong> 1kg (net)</p>\n<p data-end="788" data-start="746"><strong data-end="757" data-start="746">Finish:</strong> Smooth, detailed, and strong</p>\n<p data-end="823" data-start="791"><strong data-end="800" data-start="791">Odor:</strong> Low-odor formulation</p>\n<p data-end="892" data-start="826"><strong data-end="842" data-start="826">Ease of Use:</strong> No need for IPA; simply rinse prints with water</p>\n<p data-end="973" data-start="895"><strong data-end="908" data-start="895">Hardness:</strong> Comparable to ABS-like resin, providing strength and toughness</p>\n<p data-end="1064" data-start="976"><strong data-end="993" data-start="976">Applications:</strong> Miniatures, functional parts, jewelry, decorative models, prototypes</p>\n<p data-end="1092" data-start="1066"><strong data-end="1090" data-start="1066">Printing Parameters:</strong></p>\n<p data-end="1128" data-start="1095"><strong data-end="1126" data-start="1095">Mono Screen (LCD Printers):</strong></p>\n<p data-end="1158" data-start="1133">Bottom Exposure: 15–25s</p>\n<p data-end="1185" data-start="1163">Layer Exposure: 2–3s</p>\n<p data-end="1226" data-start="1188"><strong data-end="1224" data-start="1188">RGB Screen (Older LCD Printers):</strong></p>\n<p data-end="1256" data-start="1231">Bottom Exposure: 50–60s</p>\n<p data-end="1283" data-start="1261">Layer Exposure: 6–8s</p>\n<p data-end="1365" data-start="1285"><strong data-end="1300" data-start="1285">Shelf Life:</strong> 2 years (store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight)</p>\n<p data-end="1392" data-start="1367"><strong data-end="1390" data-start="1367">Safety Precautions:</strong></p>\n<p data-end="1419" data-start="1395">Shake well before use.</p>\n<p data-end="1463" data-start="1422">Wear gloves and a mask during handling.</p>\n<p data-end="1532" data-start="1466">Avoid direct skin contact; wash with plenty of water if exposed.</p>\n<p data-end="1551" data-start="1535">Do not ingest.</p>\n<p data-end="1586" data-start="1554">Keep out of reach of children.</p>\n<p data-end="1621" data-start="1589">Use in a well-ventilated area.</p>\n<p data-end="1840" data-start="1623"><strong data-end="1638" data-start="1623">Advantages:</strong><br data-end="1641" data-start="1638">✅ Easy water cleanup – no alcohol needed<br data-end="1684" data-start="1681">✅ High precision &amp; detail reproduction<br data-end="1725" data-start="1722">✅ Strong &amp; durable prints<br data-end="1753" data-start="1750">✅ Unique dual-color shifting resin<br data-end="1790" data-start="1787">✅ Ideal for hobbyists, makers, and professionals</p>	<p data-end="178" data-start="80"><strong data-end="97" data-start="80">Product Name:</strong><br data-end="100" data-start="97">3D Galaxy UV Sensitive Water Washable Resin </p>\n<p data-end="595" data-start="180"><strong data-end="196" data-start="180">Description:</strong><br data-end="199" data-start="196">3D Galaxy UV Sensitive Resin is designed for high-quality 3D printing, offering precision, strength, and smooth surface finishing. This <strong data-end="361" data-start="335">water washable formula</strong> makes post-processing easy, eliminating the need for harsh chemicals or alcohol cleaning. Its <strong data-end="506" data-start="456">color-shifting Crystal Orange to Purple effect</strong> gives prints a unique aesthetic appeal while maintaining durability and functionality.</p>\n<p data-end="616" data-start="597"><strong data-end="614" data-start="597">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<p data-end="658" data-start="619"><strong data-end="632" data-start="619">Material:</strong> Water Washable UV Resin</p>\n<p data-end="717" data-start="661"><strong data-end="671" data-start="661">Color:</strong> Crystal Orange to Purple (chameleon effect)<br>           Crystal Purple to Blue <br>           Crystal Purple to Pink</p>\n<p data-end="743" data-start="720"><strong data-end="731" data-start="720">Weight:</strong> 1kg (net)</p>\n<p data-end="788" data-start="746"><strong data-end="757" data-start="746">Finish:</strong> Smooth, detailed, and strong</p>\n<p data-end="823" data-start="791"><strong data-end="800" data-start="791">Odor:</strong> Low-odor formulation</p>\n<p data-end="892" data-start="826"><strong data-end="842" data-start="826">Ease of Use:</strong> No need for IPA; simply rinse prints with water</p>\n<p data-end="973" data-start="895"><strong data-end="908" data-start="895">Hardness:</strong> Comparable to ABS-like resin, providing strength and toughness</p>\n<p data-end="1064" data-start="976"><strong data-end="993" data-start="976">Applications:</strong> Miniatures, functional parts, jewelry, decorative models, prototypes</p>\n<p data-end="1092" data-start="1066"><strong data-end="1090" data-start="1066">Printing Parameters:</strong></p>\n<p data-end="1128" data-start="1095"><strong data-end="1126" data-start="1095">Mono Screen (LCD Printers):</strong></p>\n<p data-end="1158" data-start="1133">Bottom Exposure: 15–25s</p>\n<p data-end="1185" data-start="1163">Layer Exposure: 2–3s</p>\n<p data-end="1226" data-start="1188"><strong data-end="1224" data-start="1188">RGB Screen (Older LCD Printers):</strong></p>\n<p data-end="1256" data-start="1231">Bottom Exposure: 50–60s</p>\n<p data-end="1283" data-start="1261">Layer Exposure: 6–8s</p>\n<p data-end="1365" data-start="1285"><strong data-end="1300" data-start="1285">Shelf Life:</strong> 2 years (store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight)</p>\n<p data-end="1392" data-start="1367"><strong data-end="1390" data-start="1367">Safety Precautions:</strong></p>\n<p data-end="1419" data-start="1395">Shake well before use.</p>\n<p data-end="1463" data-start="1422">Wear gloves and a mask during handling.</p>\n<p data-end="1532" data-start="1466">Avoid direct skin contact; wash with plenty of water if exposed.</p>\n<p data-end="1551" data-start="1535">Do not ingest.</p>\n<p data-end="1586" data-start="1554">Keep out of reach of children.</p>\n<p data-end="1621" data-start="1589">Use in a well-ventilated area.</p>\n<p data-end="1840" data-start="1623"><strong data-end="1638" data-start="1623">Advantages:</strong><br data-end="1641" data-start="1638">✅ Easy water cleanup – no alcohol needed<br data-end="1684" data-start="1681">✅ High precision &amp; detail reproduction<br data-end="1725" data-start="1722">✅ Strong &amp; durable prints<br data-end="1753" data-start="1750">✅ Unique dual-color shifting resin<br data-end="1790" data-start="1787">✅ Ideal f