0e80d99a-7c6e-446a-888c-4d2664b2c7c9	\N	17eab5d8-a0b0-45bb-9b7f-7319e05d671c	ELEGOO ABS Like Photopolymer 3D Printer Resin	elegoo-abs-like-photopolymer-3d-printer-resin	elegoo-abs-like-photopolymer-3d-printer-resin	<p><strong>ELEGOO ABS Like Photopolymer 3D Printer Resin</strong></p>\n<p>Elevate your<span> </span><strong>3D printing experience with ELEGOO ABS-Like Photopolymer 3D Printer Resin</strong>. Crafted with precision engineering, this resin is tailored to perfection, ensuring your 3D prints reach a new level of excellence. The<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO ABS-Like Photopolymer 3D Printer Resin</strong><span> </span>offers several key features and benefits for 3D printing enthusiasts and professionals:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Low Shrinkage and High Precision:</strong><span> </span>This resin is designed to minimize volume shrinkage during the photocuring process, ensuring that your 3D printed models have high precision and a smooth finish.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fast Curing and Great Stability:</strong><span> </span><strong>ELEGOO</strong><span> </span>405nm Rapid Resin reduces printing time with excellent fluidity. Its stability and proper hardness provide a worry-free printing experience, increasing the chances of successful prints.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Bright and Stunning Colors:</strong><span> </span>The resin contains high-quality pigments and photo-initiators, resulting in 3D printed models with vibrant and captivating colors, akin to artwork.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Wide Applications:</strong><span> </span>ELEGOO standard resin is compatible with most DLP/LCD 3D printers, with the best results achieved on LCD 3D printers. It can be used for various purposes, including industrial spare parts, building models, DIY projects, board game miniatures, tools, and general modeling applications.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Safe and Secure Packaging:</strong><span> </span>The resin is securely packaged in a leak-proof bottle wrapped with a plastic bubble bag and an exquisite designed package box to prevent any spills or leakage.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Light Odor &amp; Hassle-Free:</strong><span> </span>ELEGOO prioritizes minimizing odor and health concerns. Through careful research and formulation adjustments, they have created a resin with lower odor and health impacts suitable for both beginners and experts.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fast &amp; Easy Curing:</strong><span> </span>This resin rapidly cures when exposed to UV light in the 385-410nm wavelength range, saving time and improving printing efficiency while maintaining model strength and accuracy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Less Brittleness &amp; Higher Tenacity:</strong><span> </span>The resin possesses mechanical properties similar to ABS plastic, including high impact resistance, strength, and tenacity. It results in 3D-printed objects that are less prone to fracture or deformation.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Good Fluidity &amp; Low Viscosity:</strong><span> </span>The resin has good fluidity, ensuring that it solidifies quickly to the desired shape. It flows back when the print platform rises, preventing issues like “empty curing” or “holes on the model surface.” This enhances the success rate of your prints and makes resin tank cleaning and model removal easier.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High Precision &amp; Low Shrinkage:</strong><span> </span>The resin features low volume and linear shrinkage, which leads to 3D prints with exceptionally smooth surface finishes, fine textures, and accurate dimensions, capturing even the smallest details with clarity.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High Compatibility &amp; Wide Applications:</strong><span> </span>ELEGOO photopolymer resin is compatible with most LCD 3D printers in the UV wavelength range of 385-410nm, and it is suitable for a wide range of applications due to its strength and versatility.</li>\n</ul>	<p><strong>ELEGOO ABS Like Photopolymer 3D Printer Resin</strong></p>\n<p>Elevate your<span> </span><strong>3D printing experience with ELEGOO ABS-Like Photopolymer 3D