strong><span> </span>This resin rapidly cures when exposed to UV light in the 385-410nm wavelength range, saving time and improving printing efficiency while maintaining model strength and accuracy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Less Brittleness &amp; Higher Tenacity:</strong><span> </span>The resin possesses mechanical properties similar to ABS plastic, including high impact resistance, strength, and tenacity. It results in 3D-printed objects that are less prone to fracture or deformation.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Good Fluidity &amp; Low Viscosity:</strong><span> </span>The resin has good fluidity, ensuring that it solidifies quickly to the desired shape. It flows back when the print platform rises, preventing issues like “empty curing” or “holes on the model surface.” This enhances the success rate of your prints and makes resin tank cleaning and model removal easier.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High Precision &amp; Low Shrinkage:</strong><span> </span>The resin features low volume and linear shrinkage, which leads to 3D prints with exceptionally smooth surface finishes, fine textures, and accurate dimensions, capturing even the smallest details with clarity.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High Compatibility &amp; Wide Applications:</strong><span> </span>ELEGOO photopolymer resin is compatible with most LCD 3D printers in the UV wavelength range of 385-410nm, and it is suitable for a wide range of applications due to its strength and versatility.</li>\n</ul>	2199.00	\N	\N	19	f	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443962665-407711151.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443962431-582372854.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443963334-689134276.png", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443962364-970554951.jpg"]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[{"name": "