ae406d8b-59f8-45e7-b778-4eb695d15819	\N	cfe93849-b68e-4d70-8177-028bf69cdc6a	anycubic kobra 3 hotend kit	anycubic-kobra-3-hotend-kit	anycubic-kobra-3-hotend-kit	<h3 data-start="104" data-end="157">🔧 <strong data-start="111" data-end="157">Anycubic Kobra 3 Hotend Kit – 0.4mm Nozzle</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="159" data-end="228"><strong data-start="159" data-end="228">OEM Replacement | High-Precision | Fast Heating | Easy to Install</strong></p>\n<p data-start="230" data-end="516">Upgrade or replace your existing hotend with this official <strong data-start="289" data-end="320">Anycubic Kobra 3 Hotend Kit</strong>, designed specifically for the <strong data-start="352" data-end="390">Anycubic Kobra 3 and Kobra 3 Combo</strong> 3D printers. This all-in-one module is pre-assembled and ready to install, ensuring minimal downtime and maximum performance.</p>\n<hr data-start="518" data-end="521">\n<h3 data-start="523" data-end="546">✅ <strong data-start="529" data-end="546">Key Features:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="550" data-end="702"><strong data-start="550" data-end="567">Compatibility</strong>:<br data-start="568" data-end="571">Specially made for Anycubic Kobra 3 and Kobra 3 Combo 3D printers. Plug-and-play compatible with the printer’s quick-swap design.</p>\n<p data-start="706" data-end="877"><strong data-start="706" data-end="731">Standard 0.4mm Nozzle</strong>:<br data-start="732" data-end="735">Delivers high-resolution print quality and supports a wide range of filament types including PLA, PETG, TPU, ABS, and wood-filled filaments.</p>\n<p data-start="881" data-end="1007"><strong data-start="881" data-end="909">High-Temperature Support</strong>:<br data-start="910" data-end="913">Heat-resistant components (up to 260°C) for reliable use with most consumer-grade filaments.</p>\n<p data-start="1011" data-end="1159"><strong data-start="1011" data-end="1032">Integrated Design</strong>:<br data-start="1033" data-end="1036">Includes heater block, throat tube, nozzle, thermistor, heater cartridge, and heat sink. Fully assembled for convenience.</p>\n<p data-start="1163" data-end="1322"><strong data-start="1163" data-end="1190">Quick Swap Installation</strong>:<br data-start="1191" data-end="1194">Tool-free mounting system. Simply unclip the old hotend and insert the new one – perfect for fast replacements or maintenance.</p>\n<p data-start="1326" data-end="1445"><strong data-start="1326" data-end="1352">Silicone Sock Included</strong>:<br data-start="1353" data-end="1356">Maintains thermal efficiency and keeps the hotend clean from filament drips and debris.</p>\n<hr data-start="1447" data-end="1450">\n<h3 data-start="1452" data-end="1480">📦 <strong data-start="1459" data-end="1480">Package Includes:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="1484" data-end="1511">1x Fully Assembled Hotend</p>\n<p data-start="1514" data-end="1553">1x 0.4mm Brass Nozzle (Pre-installed)</p>\n<p data-start="1556" data-end="1574">1x Silicone Sock</p>\n<p data-start="1577" data-end="1620">Pre-wired Thermistor and Heater Cartridge</p>\n<h3 data-start="1627" data-end="1658">💡 <strong data-start="1634" data-end="1658">Why Choose This Kit?</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="1660" data-end="1898">Whether you’re replacing a worn-out hotend or want a spare for different filament types, this OEM Anycubic kit is a perfect fit. It’s easy to install, made to last, and ready to deliver consistent, high-quality prints with minimal effort.</p>	<h3 data-start="104" data-end="157">🔧 <strong data-start="111" data-end="157">Anycubic Kobra 3 Hotend Kit – 0.4mm Nozzle</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="159" data-end="228"><strong data-start="159" data-end="228">OEM Replacement | High-Precision | Fast Heating | Easy to Install</strong></p>\n<p data-start="230" data-end="516">Upgrade or replace your existing hotend with this official <strong data-start="289" data-end="320">Anycubic Kobra 3 Hotend Kit</strong>, designed specifically for the <strong data-start="352" data-end="390">Anycubic Kobra 3 and Kobra 3 Combo</strong> 3D printers. This all-in-one module is pre-assembled and ready to install, ensuring minimal downtime and maximum performance.</p>\n<hr data-start="518" data-end="521">\n<h3 data-start="523" data-end="546">✅ <strong data-start="529" data-end="546">Key Features:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="550" data-end="702"><strong data-start="550" data-end="567">Compatibility</strong>:<br data-start="568" data-end="571">Specially made for Anycubic Kobra 3 and Kobra 3 Combo 3D printers. Plug-and-play compatible with the printer’s quick-swap design.</p>\n<p data-start="706" data-end="877"><strong data-start="706" data-end="731">Standard 0.4mm Nozzle</strong>:<br data-start="732" data-end="735">Delivers high-resolution print quality and supports a wide range of filament types including PLA, PETG, TPU, ABS, and wood-filled filaments.</p>\n<p data-start="881" data-end="1007"><strong data-start="881" data-end="909">High-Temperature Support</strong>:<br data-start="910" data-end="913">Heat-resistant components (up to 260°C) for reliable use with most consumer-grade filaments.</p>\n<p data-start="1011" data-end="1159"><strong data-start="1011" data-end="1032">Integrated Design</strong>:<br data-start="1033" data-end="1036">Includes heater block, throat tube, nozzle, thermistor, heater cartridge, and heat sink. Fully assembled for convenience.</p>\n<p data-start="1163" data-end="1322"><strong data-start="1163" data-end="1190">Quick Swap Installation</strong>:<br data-start="1191" data-end="1194">Tool-free mounting system. Simply unclip the old hotend and insert the new one – perfect for fast replacements or maintenance.</p>\n<p data-start="1326" data-end="1445"><strong data-start="1326" data-end="1352">Silicone Sock Included</strong>:<br data-start="1353" data-end="1356">Maintains thermal efficiency and keeps the hotend clean from filament drips and debris.</p>\n<hr data-start="1447" data-end="1450">\n<h3 data-start="1452" data-end="1480">📦 <stro