> Suitable for all filament types including PLA, ABS, PETG, TPU, Nylon, and more</p>\n<p data-start="1189" data-end="1265"><strong data-start="1189" data-end="1204">Safety Cap:</strong> Includes a protective cap to cover the blade when not in use</p>\n<hr data-start="1267" data-end="1270">\n<h3 data-start="1272" data-end="1293">🧵 <strong data-start="1279" data-end="1293">Ideal For:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="1297" data-end="1339">Preparing filament ends for smooth feeding</p>\n<p data-start="1342" data-end="1385">Trimming filament before loading or storage</p>\n<p data-start="1388" data-end="1460">Maintaining clean and consistent prints by avoiding rough or angled tips</p>\n<hr data-start="1462" data-end="1465">\n<h3 data-start="1467" data-end="1495">📦 <strong data-start="1474" data-end="1495">Package Includes:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="1499" data-end="1524">1× Filament Cutter Tool</p>\n<p data-start="1527" data-end="1572">1× Blade Safety Cap (optional based on model)</p>\n<hr data-start="1574" data-end="1577">\n<h3 data-start="1579" data-end="1616">🔧 <strong data-start="1586" data-end="1616">Why Use a Filament Cutter?</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="1620" data-end="1686">Prevents extruder issues caused by rough or uneven filament ends</p>\n<p data-start="1689" data-end="1732">Makes filament changes faster and cleaner</p>\n<p data-start="1735" data-end="1788">Ensures perfect alignment into PTFE or extruder gears</p>	<hr data-start="91" data-end="94">\n<h3 data-start="96" data-end="178">✂️ <strong data-start="103" data-end="178">Precision Filament Cutter for 3D Printing – Clean, Sharp, Accurate Cuts</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-start="180" data-end="445">Upgrade your 3D printing toolkit with this <strong data-start="223" data-end="257">high-precision filament cutter</strong>, designed to provide clean and angled cuts for all types of 3D printing filaments. Essential for ensuring smooth filament loading, reduced nozzle clogs, and optimal extrusion performance.<