ecc21b7a-bc13-4309-852d-a1fea0333f0d	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo 3D Printer	anycubic-kobra-3-max-combo-3d-printer	anycubic-kobra-3-max-combo-3d-printer	<p data-end="1148" data-start="691" class="">The<span> </span><strong data-end="725" data-start="695">Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo</strong><span> </span>is a next-generation high-performance FDM 3D printer engineered for professionals, designers, and advanced makers who require fast, precise, and large-format multicolor printing. Now officially available in India through<span> <strong>3D</strong> <strong>GALAXY</strong> </span>, this all-in-one printing solution includes the robust<span> </span><strong data-end="1044" data-start="1029">Kobra 3 Max</strong><span> </span>printer and the innovative<span> </span><strong data-end="1112" data-start="1072">ACE Pro Multi-Color Filament Dry Box</strong>, supporting up to 8-color printing.</p>\n<p data-end="1366" data-start="1150" class="">Designed for demanding workflows—from industrial prototyping to artistic and cosplay creation—the Kobra 3 Max Combo brings together speed, intelligence, and material versatility to dramatically streamline production.</p>\n<div class="wp-caption alignnone" id="attachment_25132">\n<img sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" srcset="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2.png 1920w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-300x138.png 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-1024x469.png 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-768x352.png 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-1536x704.png 1536w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-1200x550.png 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-150x69.png 150w" title="Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo – High-Speed, Ultra-Large FDM 3D Printing System with Integrated Multi-Color and Filament Drying Capabilities 1" height="880" width="1920" alt="Experience ultra-fast, multi-color 3D printing with the Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo. Now available in India from Protomont Technologies." src="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2.png" class="size-full wp-image-25132" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-25132" decoding="async" loading="lazy">\n<p class="wp-caption-text" id="caption-attachment-25132">Experience ultra-fast, multi-color 3D printing with the Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo. Now available in India from <span><strong>3D</strong> <strong>GALAXY.</strong></span> </p>\n</div>\n<h3 data-end="1408" data-start="1373" class=""><strong data-end="1408" data-start="1377">Key Features and Advantages</strong></h3>\n<h4 data-end="1462" data-start="1410" class=""><strong data-end="1462" data-start="1415">Massive Print Volume with High-Speed Output</strong></h4>\n<p data-end="1642" data-start="1465" class=""><strong data-end="1486" data-start="1465">Print Dimensions:</strong><span> </span>420 × 420 × 500 mm – equivalent to over 88 liters, suitable for full-scale objects such as pet houses, architectural models, reliefs, and batch production.</p>\n<p data-end="1775" data-start="1645" class="">Capable of printing multiple models in one batch, reducing print cycles, print time by up to 40% and filament waste by up to 60%.</p>\n<h4 data-end="1840" data-start="1777" class=""><strong data-end="1840" data-start="1782">Professional-Grade Motion Architecture and Print Speed</strong></h4>\n<p data-end="1876" data-start="1843" class=""><strong data-end="1867" data-start="1843">Maximum Print Speed:</strong><span> </span>600 mm/s</p>\n<p data-end="1948" data-start="1879" class=""><strong data-end="1896" data-start="1879">Acceleration:</strong><span> </span>Up to 10,000 mm/s² for rapid yet stable performance</p>\n<p data-end="2046" data-start="1951" class=""><strong data-end="1996" data-start="1951">Advanced Bearing &amp; Dual-Axis Core Design:</strong><span> </span>Ensures smooth, precise motion and surface finish </p>\n<p data-end="2046" data-start="1951" class="">Complete 3D Benchy in as little as 18 minutes</p>\n<h4 data-end="2168" data-start="2096" class=""><strong data-end="2168" data-start="2101">LeviQ 3.0 Automatic Leveling with Z-Axis and Motion Calibration</strong></h4>\n<p data-end="2230" data-start="2171" class="">Fully automated bed leveling with precision Z-offset tuning</p>\n<p data-end="2230" data-start="2171" class=""><strong data-end="2254" data-start="2233">Dual Y-axis motor</strong><span> </span>system improves platform stability, minimizes layer misalignment</p>\n<p data-end="2419" data-start="2322" class=""><strong data-end="2356" data-start="2322">Semi-automatic belt tensioning</strong><span> </span>eliminates step loss, ensuring consistent multicolor alignment</p>\n<h4 data-end="2474" data-start="2421" class=""><strong data-end="2474" data-start="2426">Multicolor Printing with ACE Pro Integration</strong></h4>\n<p data-end="2528" data-start="2477" class="">Standard 4-color support with a single ACE Pro unit</p>\n<p data-end="2611" data-start="2531" class="">Pairing two ACE Pro units enables up to<span> </span><strong data-end="2611" data-start="2571">8-color seamless multicolor printing</strong></p>\n<p data-end="2694" data-start="2614" class="">Fast color-switching design reduces head travel distance for enhanced efficiency</p>\n<p data-end="2782" data-start="2697" class="">Organize filament spools by color series; automatic feeding eliminates manual changes</p>\n<h4 data-end="2842" data-start="2784" class=""><strong data-end="2842" data-start="2789">Intelligent Drying and Filament Management System</strong></h4>\n<p data-end="2938" data-start="2845" class=""><strong data-end="2873" data-start="2845">ACE Pro Filament Dry Box</strong><span> </span>actively dries filament using preset parameters for PLA and PETG</p>\n<p data-end="3014" data-start="2941" class="">Supports<span> </span><strong data-end="2975" data-start="2950">drying while printing</strong><span> </span>for uninterrupted production readiness</p>\n<p data-end="3105" data-start="3017" class=""><strong data-end="3041" data-start="3017">Auto filament refill</strong><span> </span>ensures continuous printing by switching spools without pausing</p>\n<p data-end="3179" data-start="3108" class=""><strong data-end="3143" data-start="3108">Filament entanglement detection</strong><span> </span>with auto-pause and alert mechanism</p>\n<h4 data-end="3226" data-start="3181" class=""><strong data-end="3226" data-start="3186">High-Temperature All-Material Hotend</strong></h4>\n<p data-end="3314" data-start="3229" class=""><strong data-end="3255" data-start="3229">300°C High-Temp Nozzle</strong><span> </span>for compatibility with PLA, PETG, TPU, ABS, ASA, and Nylon <strong data-end="3366" data-start="3317">Aerospace-grade ceramic composite throat tube</strong><span> </span>prevents clogging and maintains extrusion stability</p>\n<p data-end="3490" data-start="3421" class=""><strong data-end="3451" data-start="3421">Quick-swap nozzle assembly</strong><span> </span>for minimal maintenance and fast setup</p>\n<h4 data-end="3536" data-start="3492" class=""><strong data-end="3536" data-start="3497">AI Monitoring and Recovery Features</strong></h4>\n<p data-end="3634" data-start="3539" class=""><strong data-end="3565" data-start="3539">AI Spaghetti Detection</strong><span> </span>detects printing failures and pauses operations to conserve material</p>\n<p data-end="3787" data-start="3637" class=""><strong data-end="3662" data-start="3637">Skip Objects Function</strong>—supported by the printer, slicing software, and app—removes failed print sections mid-job to prevent loss of remaining parts</p>\n<p data-end="3866" data-start="3790" class=""><strong data-end="3811" data-start="3790">Power-loss resume</strong><span> </span>ensures the job continues from the last known position</p>\n<p data-end="3981" data-start="3869" class=""><strong data-end="3900" data-start="3869">Real-time hotbed monitoring</strong><span> </span>with overload protection and fireproof V0-grade materials for operational safety</p>\n<h4 data-end="4031" data-start="3983" class=""><strong data-end="4031" data-start="3988">Advanced Software and Cloud Integration</strong></h4>\n<p data-end="4144" data-start="4034" class=""><strong data-end="4072" data-start="4034">Anycubic Slicer Next (OrcaSlicer+)</strong><span> </span>enables one-click slicing, multi-plate management, and batch processing</p>\n<p data-end="4218" data-start="4147" class="">Supports multiple file formats: STL, STEP, OBJ, AMF, 3MF, PLY, and more</p>\n<p data-end="4294" data-start="4221" class=""><strong data-end="4233" data-start="4221">LAN mode</strong><span> </span>for secure local network file transfer and privacy assurance</p>\n<p data-end="4394" data-start="4297" class=""><strong data-end="4313" data-start="4297">Anycubic App</strong><span> </span>provides remote print monitoring, job control, slicing, and time-lapse recording</p>\n<p data-end="4394" data-start="4297" class="">Compatible with smartphones and PCs for seamless multi-device control</p>\n<h4 data-end="4504" data-start="4468" class=""><strong data-end="4504" data-start="4473">MakerOnline Model Ecosystem</strong></h4>\n<p data-end="4575" data-start="4507" class="">Access a repository of over 3000 pre-tested models for free download</p>\n<p data-end="4668" data-start="4578" class="">Participate in global model-sharing initiatives and connect with the 3D printing community</p>\n<p data-end="4714" data-start="4671" class="">One-click slicing directly from the library</p>\n<h2 data-end="290" data-start="200" class=""><strong data-end="290" data-start="203">Anycubic Kobra Series Comparison: Kobra 3 Max Combo vs Kobra 2 Max vs Kobra 3 Combo</strong></h2>\n<div class="group pointer-events-none relative flex justify-center *:pointer-events-auto">\n<div class="tableContainer horzScrollShadows relative">\n<table data-end="3611" data-start="292" class="min-w-full">\n<thead data-end="464" data-start="292">\n<tr data-end="464" data-start="292">\n<th data-end="326" data-start="292"><strong data-end="305" data-start="294">FEATURE</strong></th>\n<th data-end="374" data-start="326"><strong data-end="349" data-start="328">KOBRA 3 MAX COMBO</strong></th>\n<th data-end="418" data-start="374"><strong data-end="391" data-start="376">KOBRA 2 MAX</strong></th>\n<th data-end="464" data-start="418"><strong data-end="437" data-start="420">KOBRA 3 COMBO</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-end="3611" data-start="637">\n<tr data-end="811" data-start="637">\n<td data-end="670" data-start="637" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]"><strong data-end="656" data-start="639">Printer Model</strong></td>\n<td data-end="719" data-start="670" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]">Kobra 3 Max Combo</td>\n<td data-end="764" data-start="719" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]">Kobra 2 Max</td>\n<td data-end="811" data-start="764" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]">Kobra 3 Combo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-end="986" data-start="812">\n<td data-end="845" data-start="812" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]"><strong data-end="830" data-start="814">Build Volume</strong></td>\n<td data-end="894" data-start="845" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]">420 × 420 × 500 mm³</td>\n<td data-end="939" data-start="894" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]">420 × 420 × 500 mm³</td>\n<td data-end="986" data-start="939" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]">250 × 250 × 260 mm³</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-end="1161" data-start="987">\n<td data-end="1020" data-start="987" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]"><strong data-end="1012" data-start="989">Maximum Print Speed</strong></td>\n<td data-end="1069" data-start="1020" class="max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-wi