ticolor Slicing &amp; Filament Management</strong>: Utilize up to<span> </span><strong>16 colors</strong><span> </span>simultaneously with the<span> </span><strong>Creality Filament System (CFS)</strong>. Connect up to four<span> </span><strong>CFS</strong><span> </span>units to print vibrant,<span> </span><strong>multicolor 3D printing</strong><span> </span>models without the need for extra post-processing painting.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-23446 size-full" src="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view3.jpg" alt="Creality K2 Plus Combo 3D Printer" width="1206" height="507" title="Creality K2 Plus Combo 3D Printer 2" srcset="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view3.jpg 1206w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view3-300x126.jpg 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view3-1024x430.jpg 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view3-768x323.jpg 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view3-1200x504.jpg 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view3-150x63.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1206px) 100vw, 1206px"></p>\n<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-23447 size-full" src="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view1.jpg" alt="Creality K2 Plus Combo 3D Printer" width="1206" height="505" title="Creality K2 Plus 