es for a<span> </span><strong>high-speed FDM 3D printer</strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Active Belt Tensioning:</strong><span> </span>The<span> </span><strong>3D Printer</strong><span> </span>automatically adjusts the<span> </span><strong>belt tension</strong><span> </span>with a pressure sensor, ensuring consistent print quality and accuracy without manual intervention.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-23453 size-full" src="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view13.jpg" alt="Creality K2 Plus Combo 3D Printer" width="1206" height="506" title="Creality K2 Plus Combo 3D Printer 8" srcset="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view13.jpg 1206w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view13-300x126.jpg 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view13-1024x430.jpg 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view13-768x322.jpg 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view13-1200x503.jpg 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Creality-official-3d-printer-online-store-k2-plus-combo-3d-printer-page-view13-150x63.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1206px) 100vw, 1206px"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Automated Run-Out &amp; Filament Cutter:</strong><span> </span>Features a<span> </span><strong>magnetic filament cutter</strong><span> </span>with a sensor to alert you when filament is running low, minimizing waste and interruptions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-23457 size-full" 