d88dfed2-9543-4265-b578-93c5c219ea3b	\N	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo	anycubic-kobra-s1-combo	anycubic-kobra-s1-combo	<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer</strong><span> </span>is a state-of-the-art<span> </span><strong>FDM 3D printer</strong><span> </span>engineered for precision,<span> </span><strong>high-speed 3D printing</strong>, and seamless<span> </span><strong>multi-color printing</strong>. Designed with a<span> </span><strong>fully enclosed CoreXY motion system</strong>, it ensures superior stability and efficiency, making it an ideal choice for<span> </span><strong>professional 3D printing</strong>, businesses, and serious hobbyists.</p>\n<p>Featuring a<span> </span><strong>250 × 250 × 250mm build size</strong>, a<span> </span><strong>printing speed of up to 600mm/s</strong>, and an<span> </span><strong>ultra-quiet 44dB operation</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic 3D printer</strong><span> </span>consistently delivers high-quality prints for<span> </span><strong>functional prototypes</strong>,<span> </span><strong>artistic models</strong>, and<span> </span><strong>complex designs</strong>. Its<span> </span><strong>320°C high-temperature hotend</strong><span> </span>supports<span> </span><strong>multi-material printing</strong>, including<span> </span><strong>PLA, ABS, ASA, PETG, and TPU</strong>, allowing users to create durable and visually impressive models effortlessly.<br><img sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" srcset="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover.webp 1500w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-300x169.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-768x432.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-1200x675.webp 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-150x84.webp 150w" title="Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer – Advanced Multi-Color FDM 3D Printer for Professional-Grade Printing 1" height="844" width="1500" alt="S1C cover" src="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover.webp" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-24831" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p>\n<h3>Key Features of Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer</h3>\n<h4>1. Fully Enclosed CoreXY Motion System for Precision Printing</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>utilizes<span> </span><strong>CoreXY technology</strong>, ensuring<span> </span><strong>motion efficiency</strong><span> </span>and minimal vibrations for<span> </span><strong>precise, high-speed 3D printing</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>CoreXY motion system</strong><span> </span>for stability and speed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Large build volume</strong><span> </span>of 250 × 250 × 250mm for versatile applications.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>600mm/s printing speed</strong><span> </span>for faster production.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>20,000mm/s² acceleration</strong><span> </span>for ultra-fast movement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Resonance and dynamic flow compensation</strong><span> </span>for smooth, high-quality prints.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2. Multi-Color Printing with Automatic Filament Management</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo</strong><span> </span>supports<span> </span><strong>4-color and 8-color printing</strong>, enabling intricate,<span> </span><strong>multi-tone 3D printing</strong><span> </span>with smooth color transitions.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>Automatic multi-filament system</strong><span> </span>for seamless color changes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anti-filament entanglement system</strong><span> </span>to prevent disruptions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Auto-filament refill feature</strong><span> </span>for uninterrupted printing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3. 320°C High-Temperature Hotend for Expanded Filament Compatibility</h4>\n<p>With its<span> </span><strong>320°C high-temperature hotend</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 3D printer</strong><span> </span>supports a variety of materials, making it a<span> </span><strong>versatile 3D printer</strong><span> </span>for different applications.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>Compatible with<span> </span><strong>PLA, ABS, ASA, PETG, TPU, and more</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy-to-disassemble hotend</strong><span> </span>for effortless maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anti-clogging nozzle design</strong><span> </span>for consistent extrusion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Aerospace-grade ceramic composite throat tube</strong><span> </span>for enhanced durability.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4. Smart Automation and Intelligent Printing Features</h4>\n<p>Equipped with advanced automation, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>enhances<span> </span><strong>print quality</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>efficiency</strong><span> </span>with intelligent monitoring.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>LeviQ 3.0 auto-leveling</strong><span> </span>for precise first-layer calibration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Z-axis offset adjustment</strong><span> </span>for optimized adhesion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Spaghetti detection</strong><span> </span>to identify failed prints.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Belt-tension monitoring</strong><span> </span>for stable motion control.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power-loss resume function</strong><span> </span>to continue prints after interruptions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5. Ultra-Quiet Operation—Ideal for Home &amp; Office Use</h4>\n<p>Designed for<span> </span><strong>low-noise 3D printing</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>operates at just<span> </span><strong>44dB</strong>, making it a<span> </span><strong>quiet 3D printer</strong><span> </span>suitable for any workspace.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>44dB ultra-quiet mode</strong><span> </span>for disturbance-free printing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optimized cooling system</strong><span> </span>for efficient heat dissipation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>6. Integrated Filament Drying for Superior Print Quality</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic ACE Pro Filament Dryer</strong><span> </span>ensures<span> </span><strong>high-quality 3D prints</strong><span> </span>by keeping filaments dry and free from moisture-related defects.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>2-in-1 printing and drying system</strong><span> </span>for enhanced material performance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Active drying technology</strong><span> </span>to eliminate warping and stringing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>7. User-Friendly Design for Effortless Setup and Operation</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D printer</strong><span> </span>is designed for ease of use, whether you’re a<span> </span><strong>beginner</strong><span> </span>or an experienced<span> </span><strong>3D printing professional</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>Quick assembly – start printing in just 15 minutes</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>4.3” adjustable touchscreen</strong><span> </span>for an intuitive user interface.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cleaning channel cut-out</strong><span> </span>for easy maintenance.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>8. Advanced Software and Remote Connectivity for Seamless Workflow</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>features<span> </span><strong>intelligent software integrations</strong>, allowing for<span> </span><strong>remote print monitoring</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>optimized slicing</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>Anycubic Slicer Next<span> </span></strong> powered by<span> </span><strong>OrcaSlicer+</strong><span> </span>for precise slicing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>LAN mode &amp; multi-plate management</strong><span> </span>for remote control.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Skip objects feature</strong><span> </span>to remove defective sections without stopping prints.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anycubic App</strong><span> </span>for<span> </span><strong>remote 3D print monitoring</strong><span> </span>and time-lapse recording.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>MakerOnline</strong><span> </span>for easy access to pre-sliced models.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Why Choose the Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer?</h3>\n<p>✔<span> </span><strong>Fully enclosed CoreXY construction</strong><span> </span>for stability and speed.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Large 250 × 250 × 250mm build volume</strong><span> </span>for diverse projects.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Multi-color filament printing</strong><span> </span>with<span> </span><strong>automatic switching</strong>.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Compatible with multiple filaments</strong>, including<span> </span><strong>high-temperature materials</strong>.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>600 mm/s ultra-fast printing</strong><span> </span>for increased productivity.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>320°C nozzle</strong><span> </span>with<span> </span><strong>anti-clogging technology</strong>.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Ultra-quiet operation (44dB)</strong><span> </span>for noise-free printing.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Integrated filament drying system</strong><span> </span>for optimal material performance.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>LeviQ 3.0 auto-leveling</strong><span> </span>for effortless calibration.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Smart monitoring features</strong>, including spaghetti detection and power-loss recovery.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Advanced software ecosystem</strong><span> </span>for seamless workflow and<span> </span><strong>remote 3D printing</strong>.</p>\n<p><img sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px" srcset="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1_2_d52f5da7-8b6f-4010-b1cb-b9c2dc1318e5.webp 650w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1_2_d52f5da7-8b6f-4010-b1cb-b9c2dc1318e5-300x138.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1_2_d52f5da7-8b6f-4010-b1cb-b9c2dc1318e5-150x69.webp 150w" title="Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer – Advanced Multi-Color FDM 3D Printer for Professional-Grade Printing 2" height="300" width="650" alt="Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer – Advanced Multi-Color FDM 3D Printer for Professional-Grade Printing" src="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1_2_d52f5da7-8b6f-4010-b1cb-b9c2dc1318e5.webp" class="size-full wp-image-24823 aligncenter" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer</strong><span> </span>is an advanced<span> </span><strong>FDM printer</strong><span> </span>offering<span> </span><strong>high-speed</strong>,<span> </span><strong>multi-color</strong>, and<span> </span><strong>professional-grade</strong><span> </span><strong>3D printing technology</strong>. Whether you’re a<span> </span><strong>professional</strong>, an<span> </span><strong>engineer</strong>, or a<span> </span><strong>hobbyist</strong>, this<span> </span><strong>all-in-one 3D printer</strong><span> </span>delivers<span> </span><strong>precision</strong>,<span> </span><strong>efficiency</strong>, and<span> </span><strong>seamless automation</strong><span> </span>for every project.</p>\n<p>For those demanding<span> </span><strong>exceptional speed, precision, and reliability</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer</strong><span> </span>is the perfect solution for<span> </span><strong>next-generation 3D printing</strong>.</p>	<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer</strong><span> </span>is a state-of-the-art<span> </span><strong>FDM 3D printer</strong><span> </span>engineered for precision,<span> </span><strong>high-speed 3D printing</strong>, and seamless<span> </span><strong>multi-color printing</strong>. Designed with a<span> </span><strong>fully enclosed CoreXY motion system</strong>, it ensures superior stability and efficiency, making it an ideal choice for<span> </span><strong>professional 3D printing</strong>, businesses, and serious hobbyists.</p>\n<p>Featuring a<span> </span><strong>250 × 250 × 250mm build size</strong>, a<span> </span><strong>printing speed of up to 600mm/s</strong>, and an<span> </span><strong>ultra-quiet 44dB operation</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic 3D printer</strong><span> </span>consistently delivers high-quality prints for<span> </span><strong>functional prototypes</strong>,<span> </span><strong>artistic models</strong>, and<span> </span><strong>complex designs</strong>. Its<span> </span><strong>320°C high-temperature hotend</strong><span> </span>supports<span> </span><strong>multi-material printing</strong>, including<span> </span><strong>PLA, ABS, ASA, PETG, and TPU</strong>, allowing users to create durable and visually impressive models effortlessly.<br><img sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" srcset="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover.webp 1500w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-300x169.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-768x432.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-1200x675.webp 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-150x84.webp 150w" title="Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer – Advanced Multi-Color FDM 3D Printer for Professional-Grade Printing 1" height="844" width="1500" alt="S1C cover" src="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover.webp" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-24831" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p>\n<h3>Key Features of Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer</h3>\n<h4>1. Fully Enclosed CoreXY Motion System for Precision Printing</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>utilizes<span> </span><strong>CoreXY technology</strong>, ensuring<span> </span><strong>motion efficiency</strong><span> </span>and minimal vibrations for<span> </span><strong>precise, high-speed 3D printing</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>CoreXY motion system</strong><span> </span>for stability and speed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Large build volume</strong><span> </span>of 250 × 250 × 250mm for versatile applications.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>600mm/s printing speed</strong><span> </span>for faster production.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>20,000mm/s² acceleration</strong><span> </span>for ultra-fast movement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Resonance and dynamic flow compensation</strong><span> </span>for smooth, high-quality prints.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2. Multi-Color Printing with Automatic Filament Management</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo</strong><span> </span>supports<span> </span><strong>4-color and 8-color printing</strong>, enabling intricate,<span> </span><strong>multi-tone 3D printing</strong><span> </span>with smooth color transitions.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>Automatic multi-filament system</strong><span> </span>for seamless color changes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anti-filament entanglement system</strong><span> </span>to prevent disruptions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Auto-filament refill feature</strong><span> </span>for uninterrupted printing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3. 320°C High-Temperature Hotend for Expanded Filament Compatibility</h4>\n<p>With its<span> </span><strong>320°C high-temperature hotend</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 3D printer</strong><span> </span>supports a variety of materials, making it a<span> </span><strong>versatile 3D printer</strong><span> </span>for different applications.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>Compatible with<span> </span><strong>PLA, ABS, ASA, PETG, TPU, and more</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy-to-disassemble hotend</strong><span> </span>for effortless maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anti-clogging nozzle design</strong><span> </span>for consistent extrusion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Aerospace-grade ceramic composite throat tube</strong><span> </span>for enhanced durability.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4. Smart Automation and Intelligent Printing Features</h4>\n<p>Equipped with advanced automation, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>enhances<span> </span><strong>print quality</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>efficiency</strong><span> </span>with intelligent monitoring.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>LeviQ 3.0 auto-leveling</strong><span> </span>for precise first-layer calibration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Z-axis offset adjustment</strong><span> </span>for optimized adhesion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Spaghetti detection</strong><span> </span>to identify failed prints.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Belt-tension monitoring</strong><span> </span>for stable motion control.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power-loss resume function</strong><span> </span>to continue prints after interruptions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5. Ultra-Quiet Operation—Ideal for Home &amp; Office Use</h4>\n<p>Designed for<span> </span><strong>low-noise 3D printing</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>operates at just<span> </span><strong>44dB</strong>, making it a<span> </span><strong>quiet 3D printer</strong><span> </span>suitable for any workspace.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>44dB ultra-quiet mode</strong><span> </span>for disturbance-free printing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optimized cooling system</strong><span> </span>for efficient heat dissipation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>6. Integrated Filament Drying for Superior Print Quality</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic ACE Pro Filament Dryer</strong><span> </span>ensures<span> </span><strong>high-quality 3D prints</strong><span> </span>by keeping filaments dry and free from moisture-related defects.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>2-in-1 printing and drying system</strong><span> </span>for enhanced material performance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Active drying technology</strong><span> </span>to eliminate warping and stringing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>7. User-Friendly Design for Effortless Setup and Operation</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D printer</strong><span> </span>is designed for ease of use, whether you’re a<span> </span><strong>beginner</strong><span> </span>or an experienced<span> </span><strong>3D printing professional</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>Quick assembly – start printing in just 15 minutes</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>4.3” adjustable touchscreen</strong><span> </span>for an intuitive user interface.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cleaning channel cut-out</strong><span> </span>for easy maintenance.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>8. Advanced Software and Remote Connectivity for Seamless Workflow</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>features<span> </span><strong>intelligent software integrations</strong>, allowing for<span> </span><strong>remote print monitoring</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>optimized slicing</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-spread="false">\n<li>\n<strong>Anycubic Slicer Next<span> </span></strong> powered by<span> </span><strong>OrcaSlicer+</strong><span> </span>for precise slicing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>LAN mode &amp; multi-plate management</strong><span> </span>for remote control.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Skip objects feature</strong><span> </span>to remove defective sections without stopping prints.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anycubic App</strong><span> </span>for<span> </span><strong>remote 3D print monitoring</strong><span> </span>and time-lapse recording.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>MakerOnline</strong><span> </span>for easy access to pre-sliced models.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Why Choose the Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer?</h3>\n<p>✔<span> </span><strong>Fully enclosed CoreXY construction</strong><span> </span>for stability and speed.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Large 250 × 250 × 250mm build volume</strong><span> </span>for diverse projects.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Multi-color filament printing</strong><span> </span>with<span> </span><strong>automatic switching</strong>.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Compatible with multiple filaments</strong>, including<span> </span><strong>high-temperature materials</strong>.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>600 mm/s ultra-fast printing</strong><span> </span>for increased productivity.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>320°C nozzle</strong><span> </span>with<span> </span><strong>anti-clogging technology</strong>.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Ultra-quiet operation (44dB)</strong><span> </span>for noise-free printing.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Integrated filament drying system</strong><span> </span>for optimal material performance.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>LeviQ 3.0 auto-leveling</strong><span> </span>for effortless calibration.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Smart monitoring features</strong>, including spaghetti detection and power-loss recovery.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Advanced software ecosystem</strong><span> </span>for seamless workflow and<span> </span><strong>remote 3D printing</strong>.</p>\n<p><img sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px" srcset="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1_2_d52f5da7-8b6f-4010-b1cb-b9c2dc1318e5.webp 650w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1_2_d52f5da7-8b6f-4010-b1cb-b9c2dc1318e5-300x138.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1_2_d52f5da7-8b6f-4010-b1cb-b9c2dc1318e5-150x69.webp 150w" title="Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer – Advanced Multi-Color FDM 3D Printer for Professional-Grade Printing 2" height="300" width="650" alt="Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer – Advanced Multi-Color FDM 3D Printer for Professional-Grade Printing" src="https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1_2_d52f5da7-8b6f-4010-b1cb-b9c2dc1318e5.webp" class="size-full wp-image-24823 aligncenter" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></p>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D