c8d5d910-d7d7-43db-a333-422ddda51fae	\N	55a711ea-3f62-443b-9b00-dc8d361e5cac	Anycubic Wash & Cure 3 Plus	anycubic-wash-cure-3-plus	anycubic-wash-cure-3-plus	<p data-start="401" data-end="942">The<span> </span><strong data-start="405" data-end="436">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is an advanced, all-in-one<span> </span><strong data-start="464" data-end="500">3D printer wash and cure station</strong><span> </span>engineered for high-performance resin post-processing. Designed to meet the needs of both hobbyists and professionals, this upgraded unit delivers increased washing volume, superior UV curing accuracy, and enhanced model compatibility. Whether you need a reliable<span> </span><strong data-start="765" data-end="802">UV curing station for 3D printing</strong><span> </span>or a space-efficient<span> </span><strong data-start="824" data-end="860">resin 3D printer post-processing</strong><span> </span>solution, the<span> </span><strong data-start="875" data-end="906">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is built to optimize your workflow.</p>\n<h2 data-start="949" data-end="999">Key Features of the Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</h2>\n<h3 data-start="1001" data-end="1050">Size Upgrade for Larger and Multiple Models</h3>\n<p data-start="1051" data-end="1358">The<span> </span><strong data-start="1055" data-end="1086">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>features a 7.6-liter washing capacity—a 13.4% increase compared to its predecessor. With a 12-liter total bucket volume, this unit is compatible with<span> </span><strong data-start="1237" data-end="1258">resin 3D printers</strong><span> </span>up to 10.6 inches, allowing users to wash and cure larger prints or multiple models simultaneously.</p>\n<h3 data-start="1360" data-end="1415">Dual-Layer Curing Platform for Maximum Efficiency</h3>\n<p data-start="1416" data-end="1693">This model introduces a brand-new<span> </span><strong data-start="1450" data-end="1480">dual-layer curing platform</strong>, increasing the number of models that can be cured per cycle. By optimizing curing space vertically, it enhances throughput and shortens production time, making it a truly<span> </span><strong data-start="1653" data-end="1692">high-capacity wash and cure station</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-start="1695" data-end="1738">IPA-Saving Adjustable Cleaning Basket</h3>\n<p data-start="1739" data-end="2053">Reduce alcohol usage while maintaining strong cleaning performance. The<span> </span><strong data-start="1811" data-end="1842">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>includes a dual-layer polypropylene (PP) basket with adjustable heights (150mm and 250mm). This allows for precise cleaning with minimal IPA consumption, compatible with build platforms from 7.6 to 10.6 inches.</p>\n<h3 data-start="2055" data-end="2107">Enhanced UV Curing with Gooseneck Light Design</h3>\n<p data-start="2108" data-end="2411">Featuring<span> </span><strong data-start="2118" data-end="2151">Flexicure gooseneck UV lights</strong>, the curing system reaches an energy intensity of 30,000 µW/cm² within a close range (1–3 cm). This design dramatically improves detail curing on complex areas such as figure skirts and top-facing surfaces, ensuring fine details are preserved and fully cured.</p>\n<h3 data-start="2413" data-end="2456">Uniform 360-Degree Curing Performance</h3>\n<p data-start="2457" data-end="2681">The<span> </span><strong data-start="2461" data-end="2492">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>utilizes a newly optimized LED lens array that increases overall curing uniformity by 20%. This results in even exposure and consistent quality across all model surfaces, from base to top.</p>\n<h3 data-start="2683" data-end="2712">Quiet, Sealed Operation</h3>\n<p data-start="2713" data-end="2922">A fully enclosed design combined with refined software control reduces operating noise significantly. This makes the unit suitable for home, office, and studio environments where quiet operation is a priority.</p>\n<h3 data-start="2924" data-end="2957">Simple, One-Touch Operation</h3>\n<p data-start="2958" data-end="3224">Users can switch between<span> </span><strong data-start="2983" data-end="3012">cleaning and curing modes</strong><span> </span>with a single button. Time settings are adjustable from 1 to 30 minutes, allowing full customization based on model size and complexity. The gooseneck UV mode can also be toggled independently for added control.</p>\n<h2 data-start="3231" data-end="3277">Why Choose the Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus?</h2>\n<p data-start="3279" data-end="3600">The<span> </span><strong data-start="3283" data-end="3314">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is a feature-rich, compact, and powerful solution for those seeking professional-grade<span> </span><strong data-start="3402" data-end="3438">resin 3D printer post-processing</strong>. It excels in both<span> </span><strong data-start="3458" data-end="3484">cleaning and UV curing</strong>, offering enhanced efficiency, improved safety, and superior results for hobbyists, engineers, and designers alike.</p>\n<p data-start="3602" data-end="3918">Its increased capacity, IPA-saving features, and powerful UV system make it one of the most advanced<span> </span><strong data-start="3703" data-end="3740">3D printer wash and cure stations</strong><span> </span>on the market today. Whether you’re printing detailed miniatures, prototypes, or production parts, this system ensures your prints are cleaned and cured with precision and care.</p>\n<p data-start="4199" data-end="4451">Enhance your<span> </span><strong data-start="4233" data-end="4273">3D printing post-processing workflow</strong>, the<span> </span><strong data-start="4279" data-end="4310">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>delivers professional performance in a compact, efficient package. It is now available from leading 3D printing suppliers and online stores.</p>\n<p data-start="4453" data-end="4619">Invest in quality, reliability, and convenience with the<span> </span><strong data-start="4510" data-end="4541">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong>—the ultimate<span> </span><strong data-start="4555" data-end="4597">resin 3D printer wash and cure station</strong><span> </span>for serious creators.</p>	<p data-start="401" data-end="942">The<span> </span><strong data-start="405" data-end="436">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is an advanced, all-in-one<span> </span><strong data-start="464" data-end="500">3D printer wash and cure station</strong><span> </span>engineered for high-performance resin post-processing. Designed to meet the needs of both hobbyists and professionals, this upgraded unit delivers increased washing volume, superior UV curing accuracy, and enhanced model compatibility. Whether you need a reliable<span> </span><strong data-start="765" data-end="802">UV curing station for 3D printing</strong><span> </span>or a space-efficient<span> </span><strong data-start="824" data-end="860">resin 3D printer post-processing</strong><span> </span>solution, the<span> </span><strong data-start="875" data-end="906">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is built to optimize your workflow.</p>\n<h2 data-start="949" data-end="999">Key Features of the Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</h2>\n<h3 data-start="1001" data-end="1050">Size Upgrade for Larger and Multiple Models</h3>\n<p data-start="1051" data-end="1358">The<span> </span><strong data-start="1055" data-end="1086">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>features a 7.6-liter washing capacity—a 13.4% increase compared to its predecessor. With a 12-liter total bucket volume, this unit is compatible with<span> </span><strong data-start="1237" data-end="1258">resin 3D printers</strong><span> </span>up to 10.6 inches, allowing users to wash and cure larger prints or multiple models simultaneously.</p>\n<h3 data-start="1360" data-end="1415">Dual-Layer Curing Platform for Maximum Efficiency</h3>\n<p data-start="1416" data-end="1693">This model introduces a brand-new<span> </span><strong data-start="1450" data-end="1480">dual-layer curing platform</strong>, increasing the number of models that can be cured per cycle. By optimizing curing space vertically, it enhances throughput and shortens production time, making it a truly<span> </span><strong data-start="1653" data-end="1692">high-capacity wash and cure station</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-start="1695" data-end="1738">IPA-Saving Adjustable Cleaning Basket</h3>\n<p data-start="1739" data-end="2053">Reduce alcohol usage while maintaining strong cleaning performance. The<span> </span><strong data-start="1811" data-end="1842">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>includes a dual-layer polypropylene (PP) basket with adjustable heights (150mm and 250mm). This allows for precise cleaning with minimal IPA consumption, compatible with build platforms from 7.6 to 10.6 inches.</p>\n<h3 data-start="2055" data-end="2107">Enhanced UV Curing with Gooseneck Light Design</h3>\n<p data-start="2108" data-end="2411">Featuring<span> </span><strong data-start="2118" data-end="2151">Flexicure gooseneck UV lights</strong>, the curing system reaches an energy intensity of 30,000 µW/cm² within a close range (1–3 cm). This design dramatically improves detail curing on complex areas such as figure skirts and top-facing surfaces, ensuring fine details are preserved and fully cured.</p>\n<h3 data-start="2413" data-end="2456">Uniform 360-Degree Curing Performance</h3>\n<p data-start="2457" data-end="2681">The<span> </span><strong data-start="2461" data-end="2492">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>utilizes a newly optimized LED lens array that increases overall curing uniformity by 20%. This results in even exposure and consistent quality across all model surfaces, from base to top.</p>\n<h3 data-start="2683" data-end="2712">Quiet, Sealed Operation</h3>\n<p data-start="2713" data-end="2922">A fully enclosed design combined with refined software control reduces operating noise significantly. This makes the unit suitable for home, office, and studio environments where quiet operation is a priority.</p>\n<h3 data-start="2924" data-end="2957">Simple, One-Touch Operation</h3>\n<p data-start="2958" data-end="3224">Users can switch between<span> </span><strong data-start="2983" data-end="3012">cleaning and curing modes</strong><span> </span>with a single button. Time settings are adjustable from 1 to 30 minutes, allowing full customization based on model size and complexity. The gooseneck UV mode can also be toggled independently for added control.</p>\n<h2 data-start="3231" data-end="3277">Why Choose the Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus?</h2>\n<p data-start="3279" data-end="3600">The<span> </span><strong data-start="3283" data-end="3314">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is a feature-rich, compact, and powerful solution for those seeking professional-grade<span> </span><strong data-start="3402" data-end="3438">resin 3D printer post-processing</strong>. It excels in both<span> </span><strong data-start="3458" data-end="3484">cleaning and UV curing</strong>, offering enhanced efficiency, improved safety, and superior results for hobbyists, engineers, and designers alike.</p>\n<p data-start="3602" data-end="3918">Its increased capacity, IPA-saving features, and powerful UV system make it one of the most advanced<span> </span><strong data-start="3703" data-end="3740">3D printer wash and cure stations</strong><span> </span>on the market today. Whether you’re printing detailed miniatures, prototypes, or production parts, this system ensures your prints are cleaned and cured with precision and care.</p>\n<p data-start="4199" data-end="4451">Enhance your<span> </span><strong data-start="4233" data-end="4273">3D printing post-processing workflow</strong>, the<span> </span><strong data-start="4279" data-end="4310">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>delivers professional performance in a compact, efficient package. It is now available from leading 3D printing suppliers and online stores.</p>\n<p data-start="4453" data-end="4619">Invest in quality, reliability, and convenience with the<span> </span><strong data-start="4510" data-end="4541">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong>—the ultimate<span> </span><strong data-start="4555" data-end="4597">resin 3D printer wash and cure station</strong><span> </span>for serious creators.</p>	19999.00	19999.00	19999.00	4	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983411-914329068.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "keywords": [], "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	\N	2026-07-19 06:58:27.963+00	2026-08-25 06:09:28.060538+00	0.00	g
