 class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-background-wrapper">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none background-image"><img data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/1caa6603-9504-4fbd-a884-655ebf59edc4.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg" class="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/1caa6603-9504-4fbd-a884-655ebf59edc4.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg" alt="K1 Max 3D Printer" width="547" height="224"></div>\n</div>\n<div class="a-section a-text-center"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-cel-widget="aplus-premium-module-3-four-column-images" data-csa-c-id="dkyia5-ywmfnr-hvkjdm-46bn2y" class="celwidget aplus-module premium-module-3-four-column-images aplus-premium">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-3 aplus-container-1">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-four-column">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none {'column-image'}"><img data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/f26ac997-c7ad-4481-840a-743f6c039c7f.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg" class="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/f26ac997-c7ad-4481-840a-743f6c039c7f.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg" alt="K1 Max 3D Printer" width="551" height="414"></div>\n<h2 class="a-section a-spacing-none column-heading"><strong>AI LiDAR Take Care First Layer</strong></h2>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-description">\n<h3 class="aplus-p3">The 1 μm resolution K1 MAX LiDAR will scan the first layer on its own. It will pause printing and tell you immediately if something goes wrong.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none {'column-image'}"><img data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/738eee5e-94a5-48a7-956a-3f0e1f2eb6b8.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg" class="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/738eee5e-94a5-48a7-956a-3f0e1f2eb6b8.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg" alt="K1 Max 3D Printer" width="547" height="410"></div>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-heading">\n<h2 class="aplus-h3 a-text-bold">AI Camera Keeps a Keen Watch</h2>\n</div>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-description">\n<h3 class="aplus-p3">K1 Max uses an AI camera to watch over spaghetti failure, foreign objects, debris, etc.supports real-time monitoring, creates time-lapses for sharing.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none {'column-image'}"><img data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/af42b3a4-801d-4c6e-a14e-377b7b32b93a.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg" class="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/af42b3a4-801d-4c6e-a14e-377b7b32b93a.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg" alt="K1 Max 3D Printer" width="540" height="405"></div>\n<h2 class="a-section a-spacing-none column-heading">Auto-leveling &amp; Self-test</h2>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-description">\n<h3 class="aplus-p3">Give a tap, and K1 MAX will self-test the extruder, heatbed, camera, fan, Auto-leveling. Any abnormality detected will prompt on the display.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none {'column-image'}"><img data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/8c5d1b66-713a-4e0f-beec-9ee65bcc2460.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg" class="" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/8c5d1b66-713a-4e0f-beec-9ee65bcc2460.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg" alt="K1 Max 3D Printer" width=