ling. This leads to smooth operation and fewer visible layer lines.</li>\n<li> 【LeviQ 2.0 Auto Leveling Smart Z-Offset】 By designing a unique module, it can intelligently compensate for Z-axis offset, while also supporting custom Z-axis compensation values, meeting the needs of different users and usage environments.</li>\n<li> 【SMART APP CONTROL】After upgrading the printer firmware to version 3.0.5 or above, the Anycubic APP offers support for various features, including online model library search, real-time video supervision, and status monitoring, online slicing and printing, time-lapse recording, as well as remote control and management. For more detailed guidance, please find the</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1713959237-2319.jpg?v=1736369183"></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1713959246-2319.jpg?v=1736369183"></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1713959254-2319.jpg?v=1736369183"></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1713959265-2319.jpg?v=1736369183"></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1713959278-2319.jpg?v=1736369183"></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1713959287-2319.jpg?v=1736369183"></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1713959295-2319.jpg?v=1736369183"></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1713959307-2319.jpg?v=1736369183"></p>	44900.00	\N	\N	0	f	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443989915-971791556.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443989894-135998423.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443989874-693439615.jpg", "http