port/1784443991260-253118218.png", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443991154-186155297.png", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443990737-64500876.png", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443994008-484981911.png", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "keywords": [], "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	\N	2026-07-19 06:58:45.253+00	2026-08-25 06:09:28.060538+00	0.00	g
4395601b-c718-4fe8-8cd0-694745a6b0da	\N	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	Anycubic Kobra 2 Pro 3D Printer	anycubic-kobra-2-pro-3d-printer	anycubic-kobra-2-pro-3d-printer	<h2>\n<br>Features </h2>\n<ol class="">\n<li>【10X Boost in Speed】Compared to mainstream FDM 3D printers, the printing speed is increased by 10 times. The maximum printing speed up to 500mm/s. Recommended print speed is 300mm/s.</li>\n<li> 【SMART APP CONTROL】 After upgrading the printer firmware to version 3.0.5 or above, the Anycubic APP offers support for various features, including online model library search, real-time video supervision and status monitoring, online slicing and printing, time-lapse recording, as well as remote control and management.</li>\n<li> 【Brand New Structure】By utilizing an optimized direct extruder and a movement structure in the extrusion system and cooling system, it can effectively and precisely deliver the filament, quickly melt and cool to form, and run smoothly to reduce layer lines.</li>\n<li> 【Smooth and Detailed】One-click vibration compensation, by detecting the resonance frequency of the X/Y axis with an internally built accelerometer G-sensor, smart adjustments are made to motion control, effectively eliminating resonance vertical lines and bracket lines.</li>\n<li> 【LeviQ 2.0 Auto Leveling Smart Z-Offse】By designing a unique module, it can intelligently compensate for Z-axis offset, while also supporting custom Z-axis compensation values, meeting the needs of different users and usage environments.</li>\n<li> 【High Power Powerful Computing】Equipped with a high-performance Cortex-A7 1.2Ghz processor, providing abundant computing power for faster calculation and command execution, which results in 10x faster printing.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857100-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857069-2320.jpg?v=1736367481" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857020-2320.jpg?v=1736367482" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857056-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857080-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857045-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857100-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722856981-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857030-2320.jpg?v=1736367483"></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857007-2320.jpg?v=1736367483"></p>	<h2>\n<br>Features </h2>\n<ol class="">\n<li>【10X Boost in Speed】Compared to mainstream FDM 3D printers, the printing speed is increased by 10 times. The maximum printing speed up to 500mm/s. Recommended print speed is 300mm/s.</li>\n<li> 【SMART APP CONTROL】 After upgrading the printer firmware to version 3.0.5 or above, the Anycubic APP offers support for various features, including online model library search, real-time video supervision and status monitoring, online slicing and printing, time-lapse recording, as well as remote control and management.</li>\n<li> 【Brand New Structure】By utilizing an optimized direct extruder and a movement structure in the extrusion system and cooling system, it can effectively and precisely deliver the filament, quickly melt and cool to form, and run smoothly to reduce layer lines.</li>\n<li> 【Smooth and Detailed】One-click vibration compensation, by detecting the resonance frequency of the X/Y axis with an internally built accelerometer G-sensor, smart adjustments are made to motion control, effectively eliminating resonance vertical lines and bracket lines.</li>\n<li> 【LeviQ 2.0 Auto Leveling Smart Z-Offse】By designing a unique module, it can intelligently compensate for Z-axis offset, while also supporting custom Z-axis compensation values, meeting the needs of different users and usage environments.</li>\n<li> 【High Power Powerful Computing】Equipped with a high-performance Cortex-A7 1.2Ghz processor, providing abundant computing power for faster calculation and command execution, which results in 10x faster printing.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857100-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857069-2320.jpg?v=1736367481" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857020-2320.jpg?v=1736367482" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857056-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857080-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857045-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857100-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722856981-2320.jpg?v=1736367483" alt=""></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857030-2320.jpg?v=1736367483"></p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857007-2320.jpg?v=1736367483"></p>	24900.00	24900.00	24900.00	0	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992293-393875364.png", "isPrimary": fa