f70301be-9c2a-4330-b6b7-0d966d93299e	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	3D Pen with LCD Display 2.0	3d-pen-with-lcd-display-2-0	3DGY001	<span>Bring your imagination to life with our 3D Pen with LCD Display 2.0. This pen allows you to express your creativity with ease. The LCD display allows you to monitor and adjust the temperature with precision, making the 3D pen simple and effortless to use. Bring your ideas to life with this advanced 3D printing tool.</span>\n<ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini" data-mce-fragment="1">\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">3D printing pen is made of eco-friendly ABS material and supplied by Premium PLA Filament Refills that are non-toxic, non-irritating and 100% derived from plants. It offers better scald prevention with 2019 upgraded features of Intelligent temperature control, fast heat dissipation technology. </span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">Simply plug-in, heat up and extrude to start your journal! Great for both beginners and experienced 3D printing enthusiasts! The filament is heated through the pen body and cooled much down even before it comes out of the nozzle, safe for kids to use. Our newly designed pen also has Auto Sleep Function.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">The aircraft-grade ceramic nozzle can endure high temperatures and its interior surface is so smooth that the PLA filament in the high temperature state is impossible to attach, thus effectively reducing the risk of clogging. And thanks to the high quality motor with stable rotation speed and strong power, the output of the filament is stable and smooth.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">Different from other 3D pens on the market, Dikale 3D pen don’t need long press button, but press button once to make the creation easily and relax children’s finger. 3 printing temperature and speed modes adjustable. Advanced LCD screen clearly display the corresponding speed.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">The 3D drawing pen is compatible with both 1.75mm PLA and ABS filaments. 3 adjustable speeds corresponding to 3 different operating temperatures are intuitively displayed on the LCD screen. </span></li>\n</ul>	<span>Bring your imagination to life with our 3D Pen with LCD Display 2.0. This pen allows you to express your creativity with ease. The LCD display allows you to monitor and adjust the temperature with precision, making the 3D pen simple and effortless to use. Bring your ideas to life with this advanced 3D printing tool.</span>\n<ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini" data-mce-fragment="1">\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">3D printing pen is made of eco-friendly ABS material and supplied by Premium PLA Filament Refills that are non-toxic, non-irritating and 100% derived from plants. It offers better scald prevention with 2019 upgraded features of Intelligent temperature control, fast heat dissipation technology. </span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">Simply plug-in, heat up and extrude to start your journal! Great for both beginners and experienced 3D printing enthusiasts! The filament is heated through the pen body and cooled much down even before it comes out of the nozzle, safe for kids to use. Our newly designed pen also has Auto Sleep Function.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">The aircraft-grade ceramic nozzle can endure high temperatures and its interior surface is so smooth that the PLA filament in the high temperature state is impossible to attach, thus effectively reducing the risk of clogging. And thanks to the high quality motor with stable rotation speed and strong power, the output of the filament is stable and smooth.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">Different from other 3D pens on the market, Dikale 3D pen don’t need long press button, but press button once to make the creation easily and relax children’s finger. 3 printing temperature and speed modes adjustable. Advanced LCD screen clearly display the corresponding speed.</span></li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1"><span class="a-list-item" data-mce-fragment="1">The 3D drawing pen is compatible with both 1.75mm PLA and ABS filaments. 3 adjustable speeds corresponding to 3 different operating temperatures are intuitively displayed on the LCD screen. </span></li>\n</ul>	499.00	499.00	499.00	0	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444052264-882586667.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444051647-930049608.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444051917-683878123.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444051648-248840061.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444052552-623393416.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444052606-655420813.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "keywords": [], "description": null}	{"mode": "default", "deliveryTime": "", "shippingCharges": 0, "shippingRegions": "", "freeShippingEligible": true}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[{"id": "Color", "name": "Color", "active": true, "values": [{"value": "", "sortOrder": 0, "displayValue": ""}, {"value": "", "sortOrder": 1, "displayValue": ""}, {"value": "", "sortOrder": 2, "displayValue": ""}, {"value": "", "sortOrder": 3, "displayValue": ""}], "required": true, "sortOrder": 0, "bundleTiers": [], "displayName": "Color", "displayType": "chip", "variantName": "Color", "selectionMode": "single"}]	\N	2026-07-19 07:01:18.559+00	2026-08-31 08:03:08.746077+00	0.00	g
a66cfe09-2d4e-420b-868b-bf1c0c9f082b	\N	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra 12K Printer : Precision, Speed, and Efficiency	elegoo-saturn-3-ultra-12k-printer-precision-speed-and-efficiency	elegoo-saturn-3-ultra-12k-printer-precision-speed-and-efficiency	<div data-id="1685070400095" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685070400095">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra 12K Printer</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Experience the ultimate printing precision and quality with the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra 12K Printer</strong>. This advanced 3D printer features a 10-inch 12K mono LCD with an impressive resolution of 11520×5120, delivering exceptional details and sharp edges in your prints. With an XY resolution of 19×24 microns, you can create highly precise and accurate models.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130448.png?v=1735112122" alt=""></p>\n<p><strong>12K Print Quality</strong></p>\n<div data-id="1685070400095" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685070400095">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p>Experience the ultimate printing precision and quality with the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra 12K Printer</strong>. This advanced 3D printer features a 10-inch 12K mono LCD with an impressive resolution of 11520×5120, delivering exceptional details and sharp edges in your prints. With an XY resolution of 19×24 microns, you can create highly precise and accurate models.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130550.png?v=1735112188" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685618192449" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685618192449">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><strong>COB+Refractive Light Source</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The COB+refractive light source technology employed by this printer ensures reduced light dispersion, resulting in uniform and consistent light distribution. This, in turn, produces high-quality prints with a smooth surface and outstanding dimensional accuracy.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130701.png?v=1735112247" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685618257988" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685618257988">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Powerful Linux System</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Equipped with a powerful Linux operating system and 4Gb RAM, the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3</strong><span> </span>Ultra offers a seamless and efficient printing experience. Enjoy stable file transfer and faster computing capabilities, enhancing your productivity and workflow.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130754.png?v=1735112298" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685622065060" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685622065060">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Wireless File Transfer</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Thanks to its wireless file transfer feature, you can conveniently transfer files via Wi-Fi at speeds of 6-10Mbps. Compatible with both 2.4G and 5G networks, this printer allows flexible file transfers from your computer or mobile device. It even comes with a detachable antenna for improved connectivity.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130928.png?v=1735112399" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685618399666" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685618399666">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Release Printing Speed</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra</strong><span> </span>introduces the ACF release film, a new standard in release printing speed. This specialized film, combined with the upcoming ELEGOO Rapid standard resin, enables printing speeds up to 3 times faster. Experience printing at speeds of up to 150 mm/h, ensuring quicker turnaround times for your projects.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131045.png?v=1735112481" alt=""></p>\n<p>With its all-metal machine body, the Saturn 3 Ultra offers enhanced stability and durability, making it suitable for frequent use. Its sleek and modern design adds a touch of elegance to your workspace, complementing your creative environment.</p>\n<p><b>Ultra-Steady Printing Performance</b></p>\n<div data-id="1685617498311" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685617498311">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p>Benefit from the ultra-steady printing performance of the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra</strong>. The integrated ball screw and dual linear guide rail in the Z-axis guarantee precise and steady movement, even at high printing speeds. This reduces layer texture on your final prints, ensuring exceptional quality.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131152.png?v=1735112545" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685624037143" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685624037143">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>4-Point Leveling System</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The 4-point leveling system simplifies the calibration process and optimizes performance. With four clockwise-tightening screws, you can easily align the printer for optimal printing results. The laser-engraved build plate provides excellent adhesion, securely holding models during printing and facilitating easy removal after completion.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131413.png?v=1735112678" alt=""></p>\n<p><b>4-Inch IPS Touch Screen</b></p>\n<p>Operating the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra</strong><span> </span>is effortless, thanks to the 4-inch HD IPS touch screen with an 800x480px resolution. The new UI interface design offers a user-friendly experience, supporting multilingualism for added convenience.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131522.png?v=1735112755" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1686907352419" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1686907352419">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Voxeldance Tango Slicer</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Choose the printing mode that best suits your needs with the Voxeldance Tango Slicer. The Saturn 3 Ultra offers three printing modes and supports the open-sourced GOO slice file format, providing flexibility and customization options.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131634.png?v=1735112857" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685621714295" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685621714295">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Excellent Printing Experience</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Enjoy an excellent printing experience with effective heat dissipation. The printer is equipped with double heat-conducting copper tubes and a larger cooling fan, ensuring optimal performance and extended service life.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131806.png?v=1735112917" alt=""></p>\n<p><span>Additionally, the </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra</strong><span> features a plug-in air purifier with an activated carbon filter to remove resin odor during printing. It also includes a USB socket reserved for dual USB air purifiers, ensuring a clean and odor-free printing environment.</span></p>\n<h3><strong> Technical Details  </strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>LCD :</strong><span> </span>10-inch 12K mono LCD</li>\n<li>\n<strong>XY resolution :</strong><span> </span>19x24 microns</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Build volume</strong><span> </span>: 218.88×122.88×260 mm³</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Printing speed  :</strong><span> </span>Up to 150mm/h</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Operating System :</strong><span> </span>Linux OS with 4Gb RAM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Connectivity :</strong>USB Interface &amp;Wifi</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Transfer speeds</strong><span> </span>: 6-10Mbps</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Layer thickness<span> </span></strong>: 0.01-0.2mm</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Leveling :</strong><span> </span>4-point leveling system</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Build plate :</strong><span> </span>Laser-engraved build plate</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Release liner film :</strong><span> </span>ACF release liner film for faster printing</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Touch screen :</strong><span> </span>4-inch HD IPS touch screen</li>\n<li>\n<strong>UI :</strong><span> </span>New UI interface supports 12 languages</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Air Purifier :</strong><span> </span>Built-in activated carbon air purifier</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Glass :</strong><span> </span>9H tempered glass</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product dimension (LWH):</strong><span> </span>305.9 x 273 x 562.5 mm</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Weight :<span> </span></strong>16.2Kg</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>	<div data-id="1685070400095" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685070400095">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra 12K Printer</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Experience the ultimate printing precision and quality with the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra 12K Printer</strong>. This advanced 3D printer features a 10-inch 12K mono LCD with an impressive resolution of 11520×5120, delivering exceptional details and sharp edges in your prints. With an XY resolution of 19×24 microns, you can create highly precise and accurate models.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130448.png?v=1735112122" alt=""></p>\n<p><strong>12K Print Quality</strong></p>\n<div data-id="1685070400095" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685070400095">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p>Experience the ultimate printing precision and quality with the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra 12K Printer</strong>. This advanced 3D printer features a 10-inch 12K mono LCD with an impressive resolution of 11520×5120, delivering exceptional details and sharp edges in your prints. With an XY resolution of 19×24 microns, you can create highly precise and accurate models.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130550.png?v=1735112188" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685618192449" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685618192449">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><strong>COB+Refractive Light Source</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The COB+refractive light source technology employed by this printer ensures reduced light dispersion, resulting in uniform and consistent light distribution. This, in turn, produces high-quality prints with a smooth surface and outstanding dimensional accuracy.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130701.png?v=1735112247" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685618257988" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685618257988">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Powerful Linux System</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Equipped with a powerful Linux operating system and 4Gb RAM, the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3</strong><span> </span>Ultra offers a seamless and efficient printing experience. Enjoy stable file transfer and faster computing capabilities, enhancing your productivity and workflow.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130754.png?v=1735112298" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685622065060" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685622065060">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Wireless File Transfer</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Thanks to its wireless file transfer feature, you can conveniently transfer files via Wi-Fi at speeds of 6-10Mbps. Compatible with both 2.4G and 5G networks, this printer allows flexible file transfers from your computer or mobile device. It even comes with a detachable antenna for improved connectivity.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_130928.png?v=1735112399" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685618399666" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685618399666">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Release Printing Speed</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra</strong><span> </span>introduces the ACF release film, a new standard in release printing speed. This specialized film, combined with the upcoming ELEGOO Rapid standard resin, enables printing speeds up to 3 times faster. Experience printing at speeds of up to 150 mm/h, ensuring quicker turnaround times for your projects.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131045.png?v=1735112481" alt=""></p>\n<p>With its all-metal machine body, the Saturn 3 Ultra offers enhanced stability and durability, making it suitable for frequent use. Its sleek and modern design adds a touch of elegance to your workspace, complementing your creative environment.</p>\n<p><b>Ultra-Steady Printing Performance</b></p>\n<div data-id="1685617498311" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685617498311">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p>Benefit from the ultra-steady printing performance of the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra</strong>. The integrated ball screw and dual linear guide rail in the Z-axis guarantee precise and steady movement, even at high printing speeds. This reduces layer texture on your final prints, ensuring exceptional quality.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131152.png?v=1735112545" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685624037143" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685624037143">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>4-Point Leveling System</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The 4-point leveling system simplifies the calibration process and optimizes performance. With four clockwise-tightening screws, you can easily align the printer for optimal printing results. The laser-engraved build plate provides excellent adhesion, securely holding models during printing and facilitating easy removal after completion.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131413.png?v=1735112678" alt=""></p>\n<p><b>4-Inch IPS Touch Screen</b></p>\n<p>Operating the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra</strong><span> </span>is effortless, thanks to the 4-inch HD IPS touch screen with an 800x480px resolution. The new UI interface design offers a user-friendly experience, supporting multilingualism for added convenience.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131522.png?v=1735112755" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1686907352419" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1686907352419">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Voxeldance Tango Slicer</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Choose the printing mode that best suits your needs with the Voxeldance Tango Slicer. The Saturn 3 Ultra offers three printing modes and supports the open-sourced GOO slice file format, providing flexibility and customization options.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131634.png?v=1735112857" alt=""></p>\n<div data-id="1685621714295" data-ver="1" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-atomgroup="element" data-key="text-block" data-label="Text Block" class="element-wrap" id="e-1685621714295">\n<div data-gramm="false" data-lt-tmp-id="lt-614691" data-exc="" data-gemlang="en" spellcheck="false" class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-left-xs">\n<p><b>Excellent Printing Experience</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Enjoy an excellent printing experience with effective heat dissipation. The printer is equipped with double heat-conducting copper tubes and a larger cooling fan, ensuring optimal performance and extended service life.</p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/Screenshot_2024-12-25_131806.png?v=1735112917" alt=""></p>\n<p><span>Additionally, the </span><strong>ELEGOO Saturn 3 Ultra</strong><span> features a plug-in air purifier with an activated carbon filter to remove resin odor during printing. It also includes a USB socket reserved for dual USB air purifiers, ensuring a clean and odor-free printing environment.</span></p>\n<h3><strong> Technical Details  </strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>LCD :</strong><span> </span>10-inch 12K mono LCD</li>\n<li>\n<strong>XY resolution :</strong><span> </span>19x24 microns</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Build volume</strong><span> </span>: 218.88×122.88×260 mm³</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Printing speed  :</strong><span> </span>Up to 150mm/h</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Operating System :</strong><span> </span>Linux OS with 4Gb RAM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Connectivity :</strong>USB Interface &amp;Wifi</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Transfer speeds</strong><span> </span>: 6-10Mbps</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Layer thickness<span> </span></strong>: 0.01-0.2mm</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Leveling :</strong><span> </span>4-point leveling system</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Build plate :</strong><span> </span>Laser-engraved build plate</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Release liner film :</strong><span> </span>ACF release liner film for faster printing</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Touch screen :</strong><span> </span>4-inch HD IPS touch screen</li>\n<li>\n<strong>UI :</strong><span> </span>New UI interface supports 12 languages</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Air Purifier :</strong><span> </span>Built-in activated carbon air purifier</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Glass :</strong><span> </span>9H tempered glass</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product dimension (LWH):</strong><span> </span>305.9 x 273 x 562.5 mm</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Weight :<span> </span></strong>16.2Kg</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>	42999.00	\N	\N	0	f	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992798-943481769.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443993349-270168145.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443993478-108057112.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443993134-566954922.jpg"]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "description": null}	{}	{}	