System:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The efficient cooling system, with cooling fans and heat-conducting copper tubes on both sides of the COB light source, ensures proper heat dissipation. This maintains a stable temperature during printing, ultimately extending the service life of the printer.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Hassle-free Slicing:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong><span> </span>is compatible with Tango and ChituBox for easy slicing according to your 3D printing needs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Additional Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The printer has a<span> </span><strong>lighter build</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>print components</strong>, contributing to enhanced efficiency.</li>\n<li>An<span> </span><strong>electronic auto feeding system</strong><span> </span>for resin ensures a seamless printing experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Faster resin emptying</strong><span> </span>and an<span> </span><strong>improved cooling system</strong><span> </span>contribute to a smoother workflow.</li>\n<li>Versatility for printing<span> </span><strong>miniatures</strong>,<span> </span><strong>large objects</strong>, and intricate<span> </span><strong>sculptures</strong>.</li>\n<li>Offers a<span> </span><strong>stand</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>filament version</strong><span> </span>for<span> </span><strong>diverse printing options</strong>.</li>\n</ul>	<h1><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>Jupiter SE<span> </span></strong>Experience the limitless potential of 3D printing with the<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong>. This affordable marvel for large format resin 3D printing boasts a<span> </span><strong>12.8-inch 6K</strong><span> </span>monochrome<span> </span><strong>LCD 3D Printer</strong>, ensuring precision with a<span> </span><strong>51-micron XY</strong><span> </span>resolution. With innovative features catering to professionals and enthusiasts, th