nt components</strong>, contributing to enhanced efficiency.</li>\n<li>An<span> </span><strong>electronic auto feeding system</strong><span> </span>for resin ensures a seamless printing experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Faster resin emptying</strong><span> </span>and an<span> </span><strong>improved cooling system</strong><span> </span>contribute to a smoother workflow.</li>\n<li>Versatility for printing<span> </span><strong>miniatures</strong>,<span> </span><strong>large objects</strong>, and intricate<span> </span><strong>sculptures</strong>.</li>\n<li>Offers a<span> </span><strong>stand</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>filament version</strong><span> </span>for<span> </span><strong>diverse printing options</strong>.</li>\n</ul>	64999.00	64999.00	64999.00	0	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018274-267063235.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018141-794821639.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018120-270038949.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018115-650033162.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444020070-107218689.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444020138-828429901.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444020207-839607480.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444020690-433931386.jpg",