ndard Resin</strong><span> </span>is compatible with most DLP/LCD 3D printers. However, it truly shines when paired with LCD 3D printers. From board game miniatures to industrial components,<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO</strong><span> </span>is your versatile partner in bringing ideas to life.</li>\n</ul>	<h4><strong>ELEGOO Standard Photopolymer High Precision 3D Printer Resin</strong></h4>\n<p>Introducing the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Standard Photopolymer 3D Printer Resin</strong><span> </span>– your key to unlocking the world of flawless<span> </span><strong>3D printing</strong>. Crafted with precision and innovation, our resin is engineered to meet the highest standards of quality and performance. Elevate your<strong><span> </span>3D printing experience with ELEGOO.</strong></p>\n<p>Are you tired of subpar prints with uneven finishes?<strong><span> </span>ELEGOO photopolymer resin</strong><span> </span>is specially designed to minimize volume shrinkage during the photocuring process, guaranteeing high-precision print models with a smooth, impeccable finish. Say goodbye to imperfections and hello to perfection.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Low Shrinkage, High Precision</strong>:<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO’s resin</strong><span> </span>is formulated to minimize volume shrinkage during photocuring, ensuring your prints are remarkably precise. Say goodbye to print imperfections and hello to perfection.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fast Curing, Great Stability</strong>: Our 405nm Rapid Resin is engineered for swift curing, significantly reducing your printing time. Experience the benefits of excellent fluidity, coupled with great stability and optimal hardness for worry-free, successful printing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Bright and Stunning Colors</strong>: Elevate your 3D prints with vibrant, true-to-life colors. Thanks to our high-quality pigments and photoinitiators, every print is a masterpiece, a true work of art.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Wide Applications</strong>:<strong><span> </span>ELEGOO Standard Resin</strong><span> </span>is compatible with most DLP/LCD 3D printers. However, it truly shines when paired with LCD 3D printers. From board game miniatures to industrial components,<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO</strong><span> </span>is your versatile partner in bringing ideas to life.</li>\n</ul>	1699.00	\N	\N	34	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444013732-711830361.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444013694-138377869.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444013696-154828230.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444013652-750529531.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444015054-27513181.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444015537-384191328.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444015858-629428385.webp", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444016104-355084631.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444017381-274551946.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444017837-6537328.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444017824-773383704.webp", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018710-381953437.webp", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444019638-283830424.webp"]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[{"name": "Color", "values": ["BLACK", "BLUE", "GRAY", "YELLOW", "RED", "GREEN", "MAROON", "TRNSLUCENT", "SKIN", "CLEAR B