b42f0eef-c6d5-4bd9-953e-0dfaba0d8ec6	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	Creality Ender-3 3D Printer DIY	creality-ender-3-3d-printer-diy	creality-3d-ender-3-3d-printer-diy	<ul data-mce-fragment="1">\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">Easier to assembly than anet a8. Only need to 12 steps can complete installation the creality 3d ender-3 3d printer. Save your install time, make more enjoy.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">Upgrade mk-10 extruder. Reduces plugging risk and bad extrustion. Make the printing process easier and reduce unnecessary trouble.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">Resume printing. Safely protected power supply and resume printing function, if the machine is shut down or power failure accidentally, it can continue printing after power on.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">Adopts v-slot linear bearing system and wheel moving parts, super noiseless and smooth printing performance, big hand twist nut ma ke the print platform easier to level.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">High quality 3d printer with ±0.1mm high printing accuracy, 220 * 220 * 250mm large printing size with one-piece structure.</li>\n</ul>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_1_600x600.jpg?v=1656140730" style="float: none;"></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span>3D GALAXY Creality Ender 3 is a stable and reliable 3D printing machine for beginners and DIY enthusiasts. It features a smart power supply, a magnetic build surface plate and an MK10 extruder. This printer is designed to reach printing temperature in just 5 minutes. It has an improved Y axis base for better overall stability while printing. It is suitable for printing large and complex models.</span></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span></span></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span></span></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span></span></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span><img style="float: left;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender2_480x480.jpg?v=1656142698"> </span></div>\n<div style="text-align: right;" data-mce-style="text-align: right;">\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">FDM Printing Machine</h4>\n<p>This 3D printing machine works on a smart and sophisticated printing method known as Fusion Deposition Modelling (FDM), in which a thermally sensitive filament is heated to its melting point and extruded through a precision extruder layer after layer to create a three-dimensional object. This method is simple yet provides realistic quality output and can be used by beginners and experts.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img style="float: right;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_3_480x480.jpg?v=1656142833"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini"></h4>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini"></h4>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">Recovered Print Function</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">This machine is incorporated with recovered printing function that can resume an unfinished operation which may have been interrupted due to power outage or unforeseen incidents. This prevents you from starting all over again and helps save time and filament. It can resume printing from the last recorded extruder position.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_4_480x480.jpg?v=1656142876" data-mce-style="float: left;" data-mce-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_4_480x480.jpg?v=1656142876"></p>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">Stable Mechanical Structure</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">This powerful printing machine is integrated with a CNC machining Y-Rail mounting groove to precisely position itself. It is also built-in with V-slot and POM-Wheels that render smooth operation with minimal noise. Together, these components allow the printer to remain stable and function with high precision.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender5_480x480.jpg?v=1656142906" style="float: right;" data-mce-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender5_480x480.jpg?v=1656142906" data-mce-style="float: right;"></p>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">Functional Print Bed</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">The print bed of this printing machine has a large build volume of about 220*220*250mm (8.6x8.6x9.8 inches). This allows you to print large and sophisticated models effortlessly, after which you can also detach the print bed to shift the model for cooling and inspection. A magnetic viscous platform sticker is also provided as a mean to reduce warping and replace tapes/glue.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_6_480x480.jpg?v=1656142946"></p>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">MK 10 Extruder</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">This functional 3D printer is equipped with an equally functional MK10 extruder that facilitates easy filament loading and unloading. It has a larger hot nozzle for smooth and uninterrupted filament flow. It also features throat adjustment and set screw locking mechanism so that it dispenses accurate amount of filament.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: right;" data-mce-fragment="1" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_7_480x480.jpg?v=1656142983" data-mce-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_7_480x480.jpg?v=1656142983"></p>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">Easy to Install</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">This printing machine is great for beginners as it is delivered in a semi-assembled state. The complete installation process takes about 10 minutes to finish. The process includes 20-screws assembly before you can begin printing. It also teaches first time users about the basics of 3D printer assembly.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_8_480x480.jpg?v=1656143162" alt=""></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>	<ul data-mce-fragment="1">\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">Easier to assembly than anet a8. Only need to 12 steps can complete installation the creality 3d ender-3 3d printer. Save your install time, make more enjoy.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">Upgrade mk-10 extruder. Reduces plugging risk and bad extrustion. Make the printing process easier and reduce unnecessary trouble.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">Resume printing. Safely protected power supply and resume printing function, if the machine is shut down or power failure accidentally, it can continue printing after power on.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">Adopts v-slot linear bearing system and wheel moving parts, super noiseless and smooth printing performance, big hand twist nut ma ke the print platform easier to level.</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment="1">High quality 3d printer with ±0.1mm high printing accuracy, 220 * 220 * 250mm large printing size with one-piece structure.</li>\n</ul>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_1_600x600.jpg?v=1656140730" style="float: none;"></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span>3D GALAXY Creality Ender 3 is a stable and reliable 3D printing machine for beginners and DIY enthusiasts. It features a smart power supply, a magnetic build surface plate and an MK10 extruder. This printer is designed to reach printing temperature in just 5 minutes. It has an improved Y axis base for better overall stability while printing. It is suitable for printing large and complex models.</span></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span></span></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span></span></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span></span></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><span><img style="float: left;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender2_480x480.jpg?v=1656142698"> </span></div>\n<div style="text-align: right;" data-mce-style="text-align: right;">\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">FDM Printing Machine</h4>\n<p>This 3D printing machine works on a smart and sophisticated printing method known as Fusion Deposition Modelling (FDM), in which a thermally sensitive filament is heated to its melting point and extruded through a precision extruder layer after layer to create a three-dimensional object. This method is simple yet provides realistic quality output and can be used by beginners and experts.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img style="float: right;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_3_480x480.jpg?v=1656142833"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini"></h4>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini"></h4>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">Recovered Print Function</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">This machine is incorporated with recovered printing function that can resume an unfinished operation which may have been interrupted due to power outage or unforeseen incidents. This prevents you from starting all over again and helps save time and filament. It can resume printing from the last recorded extruder position.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_4_480x480.jpg?v=1656142876" data-mce-style="float: left;" data-mce-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_4_480x480.jpg?v=1656142876"></p>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">Stable Mechanical Structure</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">This powerful printing machine is integrated with a CNC machining Y-Rail mounting groove to precisely position itself. It is also built-in with V-slot and POM-Wheels that render smooth operation with minimal noise. Together, these components allow the printer to remain stable and function with high precision.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender5_480x480.jpg?v=1656142906" style="float: right;" data-mce-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender5_480x480.jpg?v=1656142906" data-mce-style="float: right;"></p>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">Functional Print Bed</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">The print bed of this printing machine has a large build volume of about 220*220*250mm (8.6x8.6x9.8 inches). This allows you to print large and sophisticated models effortlessly, after which you can also detach the print bed to shift the model for cooling and inspection. A magnetic viscous platform sticker is also provided as a mean to reduce warping and replace tapes/glue.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_6_480x480.jpg?v=1656142946"></p>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">MK 10 Extruder</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">This functional 3D printer is equipped with an equally functional MK10 extruder that facilitates easy filament loading and unloading. It has a larger hot nozzle for smooth and uninterrupted filament flow. It also features throat adjustment and set screw locking mechanism so that it dispenses accurate amount of filament.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: right;" data-mce-fragment="1" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_7_480x480.jpg?v=1656142983" data-mce-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_7_480x480.jpg?v=1656142983"></p>\n<h4 style="text-align: left;" class="a-spacing-mini">Easy to Install</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">This printing machine is great for beginners as it is delivered in a semi-assembled state. The complete installation process takes about 10 minutes to finish. The process includes 20-screws assembly before you can begin printing. It also teaches first time users about the basics of 3D printer assembly.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/ender_8_480x480.jpg?v=1656143162" alt=""></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>	19000.00	13999.00	13999.00	3	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444030953-120671850.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444030933-324970803.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444031081-912778004.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https: