 And remote control<br><strong>Safety :</strong> Cable tagged for safe protection </p>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: none;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/light_240x240.jpg?v=1642599794" width="240x240" height="240x240"></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"></div>\n<div style="text-align: left;"></div>\n<h3 style="text-align: left;"><strong>INSTRUCTIONS FOR USE </strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>long touch the sensor to  turn on/off &amp; change colors .</li>\n<li>Also can be turned on /off, color change ,brightness &amp;  dimness using remote </li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Charging Time : </strong>120 minutes , while charging the red light  indicator will turn on .once the battery is completely charged ,the  green indicator shall turn on automatically . </p>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: none;" alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/light_size_240x240.jpg?v=1642600285"></div>\n<p> </p>	300.00	\N	\N	0	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444049292-888355267.png"]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[{"name": "Title", "values": ["Default Title"]}]	\N	2026-07-19 07:01:15.425+00	2026-07-19 07:01:15.425+00	0.00	g
ab009638-f1c8-4e54-9cbc-4778b916a1d8	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	Ender-3 Neo 3D Printer	ender-3-neo-3d-printer	ender-3-neo-3d-printer	<hr noshade size="1" class="bucketDivider" data-mce-fragment="1">\n<h2 data-mce-fragment="1">Product Description</h2>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/f070b1a8-bdd9-4676-87d6-d41f741f94d0.__CR0_70_1200_360_PT0_SX600_V1_480x480.jpg?v=1670585893"></p>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/971bb68d-cd7c-4486-940b-f705963ed95a.__CR0_0_750_750_PT0_SX300_V1_480x480.jpg?v=1670586052"></div>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">No Fear of Outage</h4>\n<p>The resume printing function can accurately record the data and can resume the print from where it's left off, avoiding printing failure and material wasting.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div style="text-align: right;"><img style="float: right;" alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/9ac911b5-a70f-4d35-9e67-2eab25cb7479.__CR0_0_750_750_PT0_SX300_V1_480x480.jpg?v=1670586178"></div>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">Enjoy Quiet Printing</h4>\n<p>With a silent mainboard, low decibel has less impact on study or work, creating cozy printing atmosphere.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/c953fdcc-e0ed-4e86-8b76-36270642f1ea.__CR0_0_750_750_PT0_SX300_V1_480x480.jpg?v=1670676390"></div>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">Hands-on Fun</h4>\n<p>Independently assemble the printer and have fun. Modify a 3D printer,enjoy DIY.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div style="text-align: right;"><img style="float: right;" alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/f4d20b42-a2d6-41f2-8972-18c9fe019e73.__CR0_0_300_300_PT0_SX300_V1_480x480.jpg?v=1670676435"></div>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">CR Touch Auto Leveling</h4>\n<p>With CR Touch, the print height of the 16 points on the build surface can be automatically compensated, ensuring the leveling accuracy and enhancing the printing quality.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/7560e3f5-60d2-418d-98ff-c4289cdf8cb5.__CR0_0_300_300_PT0_SX300_V1_480x480.jpg?v=1670676481"></div>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">Silent Motherboard</h4>\n<p>This Ender 3 Neo equipped with self-developed silent motherboard, which has stronger anti-interference, faster and more stable motion performance, silent printing and low decibel operation, create a quiet environment.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div style="text-align: right;"><img style="float: right;" alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/6867e196-b01b-4061-ab96-a87fbfcf284c.__CR0_1_300_300_PT0_SX300_V1_480x480.jpg?v=1670676528"></div>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">Full-metal Extruder</h4>\n<p>The full-metal extruder has greater extrusion force and is more durable, reducing the risk of nozzle blockage.</p>	<hr noshade size="1" class="bucketDivider" data-mce-fragment="1">\n<h2 data-mce-fragment="1">Product Description</h2>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/f070b1a8-bdd9-4676-87d6-d41f741f94d0.__CR0_70_1200_360_PT0_SX600_V1_480x480.jpg?v=1670585893"></p>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/971bb68d-cd7c-4486-940b-f705963ed95a.__CR0_0_750_750_PT0_SX300_V1_480x480.jpg?v=1670586052"></div>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">No Fear of Outage</h4>\n<p>The resume printing function can accurately record the data and can resume the print from where it's left o