sign, a perfect container for gadgets.</p>\n</div>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-heading" style="text-align: left;" data-mce-style="text-align: left;">\n<h1 class="aplus-h3 a-text-bold"><br></h1>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/9_480x480.jpg?v=1681292033" style="float: left;" data-mce-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/9_480x480.jpg?v=1681292033" data-mce-style="float: left;"></p>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-heading">\n<h1 class="aplus-h3 a-text-bold">Three-Step Quick Assembly</h1>\n</div>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-description">\n<p class="aplus-p3">It only takes 3 steps to complete the installation out of the box. Simple operation and avoid various problems caused by installation errors.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-description"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>	26000.00	21500.00	\N	9	f	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444053355-958662558.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444053346-895297154.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444053351-395333935.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444053379-669280059.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444054183-832170449.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055009-934261667.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055155-958248781.jpg"]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[{"name": "Title", "values": ["Default Title"]}]	\N	2026-07-19 07:01:24.35+00	2026-07-19 07:01:24.35+00	0.00	g
