82a5c4c4-71f0-499d-9659-3bbc5bce3168	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	55a711ea-3f62-443b-9b00-dc8d361e5cac	Extruder Pneumatic Knob PC4-M10	extruder-pneumatic-knob-pc4-m10	extruder-pneumatic-knob-pack-of-2	<span>The PC4-M10 extruder pneumatic knob is a component used in 3D printing to regulate the flow of filament from the printer's nozzle. It is designed to fit onto the pneumatic push-fit connector and provides a comfortable grip for manual adjustment of the filament feed rate. This knob allows for precise control over the extrusion process, ensuring high-quality prints with accurate and consistent filament flow.</span>	<span>The PC4-M10 extruder pneumatic knob is a component used in 3D printing to regulate the flow of filament from the printer's nozzle. It is designed to fit onto the pneumatic push-fit connector and provides a comfortable grip for manual adjustment of the filament feed rate. This knob allows for precise control over the extrusion process, ensuring high-quality prints with accurate and consistent filament flow.</span>	60.00	60.00	60.00	4	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444057612-903082968.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444057634-519543617.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444057590-224287651.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444057593-861526264.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058353-561188689.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "keywords": [], "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	\N	2026-07-19 07:01:35.951+00	2026-08-27 16:06:1