c7bcd305-d7bb-4741-9c61-958ba2e1a5d1	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	55a711ea-3f62-443b-9b00-dc8d361e5cac	CR-10 Heating Block	cr-10-heating-block	cr-10-heating-block-pack-of-2	<p>The CR-10 heating block is an essential component of a 3D printer that is responsible for heating the filament to its melting point before extrusion. The heating block is typically made of high-quality aluminum alloy to ensure efficient heat transfer and maintain a stable temperature during the printing process.</p>\n<p>The CR-10 heating block typically consists of a hollow cavity designed to hold a heating element, such as a cartridge heater or a thermistor, which is used to monitor the temperature of the block. A nozzle is screwed into the bottom of the block, which is responsible for extruding the melted filament through its small opening.</p>\n<p>To ensure efficient printing, the heating block must be capable of reaching and maintaining high temperatures for extended periods. The CR-10 heating block is designed to work with a variety of different filaments, including PLA, ABS, PETG, and TPU, and is often compatible with a range of different nozzle sizes to accommodate different printing requirements.</p>\n<p>It's important to note that heating blocks can wear out over time due to high-temperature cycling, so it's important to regularly inspect and replace the heating block to ensure optimal performance and printing quality.</p>	<p>The CR-10 heating block is an essential component of a 3D printer that is responsible for heating the filament to its melting point before extrusion. The heating block is typically made of high-quality aluminum alloy to ensure efficient heat transfer and maintain a stable temperature during the printing process.</p>\n<p>The CR-10 heating block typically consists of a hollow cavity designed to hold a heating element, such as a cartridge heater or a thermistor, which is used to monitor the temperature of the block. A nozzle is screwed into the bottom of the block, which is responsible for extruding the melted filament through its small opening.</p>\n<p>To ensure efficient printing, the heating block must be capable of reaching and maintaining high temperatures for extended periods. The CR-10 heating block is designed to work with a variety of different filaments, including PLA, ABS, PETG, and TPU, and is often compatible with a range of different nozzle sizes to accommodate different printing requirements.</p>\n<p>It's important to note that heating blocks can wear out over time due to high-temperature cycling, so it's important to regularly inspect and replace the heating block to ensure optimal performance and printing quality.</p>	149.00	149.00	149.00	77	t	f	f	t	0.00	3	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055171-654232076.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055173-179197753.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055632-418067461.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055626-596465261.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	{"title": null, "keywords": [], "description": null}	{}	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	\N	2026-07-19 07:01:30.456+00	2026-08-01 08:54:28.732185+00	0.00	g
37783d07-db80-4458-b9fd-8995645dc73e	ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5	818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d	Creality HALOT-LITE	creality-halot-lite	creality-halot-lite	<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-1_480x480.jpg?v=1682596607"></p>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-2_480x480.jpg?v=1682596689"></div>\n<h3 class="a-spacing-mini">Creality Halot Lite Resin 3D Printer</h3>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini a-color-secondary a-text-italic">Creality Self-developed Integral Light Source</h4>\n<p class="a-spacing-base">Halot Lite adopts the Self-developed integral light source, which makes the light intensity distribution of the whole screen uniform and consistent accuracy. Using 8.9" 4K Monochrome LCD, which can reach high precision, high saturation and 80%+ uniformity.</p>\n<div class="amp-centerthirdcol-listbox">\n<div class="a-box a-spacing-small a-color-alternate-background apm-listbox amp-centerthirdcol-listbox">\n<div class="a-box-inner" style="text-align: left;">\n<ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">\n<li><span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">Self-developed High Performance Mainboard</span></span></li>\n<li><span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">8.9 Inch Monochrome LCD of 4K HD 3840*2400 Resolution</span></span></li>\n<li><span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">Efficient Cooling and Filtration System</span></span></li>\n<li><span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">Creality New Slicing Software HALOT BOX</span></span></li>\n<li>\n<span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">Larger Printing Size 192*120*200mm</span></span> <span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base"><img data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3152727f-04f3-411c-9c02-160bb25a96ea.__CR0,0,350,175_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg" class="a-spacing-mini" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3152727f-04f3-411c-9c02-160bb25a96ea.__CR0,0,350,175_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg" alt="1"></span></span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class="a-color-secondary">CREALITY</h5>\n<p class="a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary">Creality is the evangelist of 3D printing industry. We work to design quality, innovative, easy-to-use 3D printers that inspire our customers to create reality and achieve dreams.</p>\n<p class="a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary">We are committed to transcending the limits of creality ,narrows the gap of family connection,endows better education condition to your children and makes your dreams shine with the glitter of stars and ocean.</p>\n<p class="a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-3_480x480.jpg?v=1682596795" style="float: right;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">High Precision Integral Light Source</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">Self-developed integral light source adopts the reflection &amp; refraction to make the light intensity distribution of the whole screen uniform, the uniformity of light source energy can reach more than 80%. When the individual lamp beads are attenuated, the uniformity of the printed model is not affected.</p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-4_480x480.jpg?v=1682596895" style="float: left;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">Capture Details</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">Creality Halot Lite 3D Printers comes with a 4K 8.9-inch Monochrome LCD with 3840*2400 resolution. Which means faster printing speed, higher printing efficiency and precision.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-5_480x480.jpg?v=1682597034" style="float: right;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">Efficient Cooling and Filtration</h4>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">System</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">Specially designed dual heat dissipation system, precise and intelligent control to detect and evaporate heat. Activated carbon air filtration can effectively reduce the odor emission and offer you a refreshing printing experience.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-6_480x480.jpg?v=1682597135" style="float: left;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">Larger Printing Size</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">192*120*200mm molding space to realize your creative potential. More larger model you needed can be printed with this printer.</p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-7_480x480.jpg?v=1682597202" style="float: right;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">Wifi/APP Remote Control</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">Creality Cloud App for mornitor printing progress, adjust the printing settings. Built-in Wifi allows one-click upgrades to the firmware.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-8_480x480.jpg?v=1682597272" style="float: left;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">5'' Color Touch Screen</h4>\n<p>5-inch color touch screen with simple visual interface for you to easily control the operation of Halot Lite.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-9_480x480.jpg?v=1682597308" width="548" height="169"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>	<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-1_480x480.jpg?v=1682596607"></p>\n<div style="text-align: left;"><img style="float: left;" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-2_480x480.jpg?v=1682596689"></div>\n<h3 class="a-spacing-mini">Creality Halot Lite Resin 3D Printer</h3>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini a-color-secondary a-text-italic">Creality Self-developed Integral Light Source</h4>\n<p class="a-spacing-base">Halot Lite adopts the Self-developed integral light source, which makes the light intensity distribution of the whole screen uniform and consistent accuracy. Using 8.9" 4K Monochrome LCD, which can reach high precision, high saturation and 80%+ uniformity.</p>\n<div class="amp-centerthirdcol-listbox">\n<div class="a-box a-spacing-small a-color-alternate-background apm-listbox amp-centerthirdcol-listbox">\n<div class="a-box-inner" style="text-align: left;">\n<ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">\n<li><span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">Self-developed High Performance Mainboard</span></span></li>\n<li><span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">8.9 Inch Monochrome LCD of 4K HD 3840*2400 Resolution</span></span></li>\n<li><span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">Efficient Cooling and Filtration System</span></span></li>\n<li><span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">Creality New Slicing Software HALOT BOX</span></span></li>\n<li>\n<span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base">Larger Printing Size 192*120*200mm</span></span> <span class="a-list-item"><span class="a-size-base"><img data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3152727f-04f3-411c-9c02-160bb25a96ea.__CR0,0,350,175_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg" class="a-spacing-mini" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3152727f-04f3-411c-9c02-160bb25a96ea.__CR0,0,350,175_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg" alt="1"></span></span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class="a-color-secondary">CREALITY</h5>\n<p class="a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary">Creality is the evangelist of 3D printing industry. We work to design quality, innovative, easy-to-use 3D printers that inspire our customers to create reality and achieve dreams.</p>\n<p class="a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary">We are committed to transcending the limits of creality ,narrows the gap of family connection,endows better education condition to your children and makes your dreams shine with the glitter of stars and ocean.</p>\n<p class="a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-3_480x480.jpg?v=1682596795" style="float: right;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">High Precision Integral Light Source</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">Self-developed integral light source adopts the reflection &amp; refraction to make the light intensity distribution of the whole screen uniform, the uniformity of light source energy can reach more than 80%. When the individual lamp beads are attenuated, the uniformity of the printed model is not affected.</p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-4_480x480.jpg?v=1682596895" style="float: left;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">Capture Details</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">Creality Halot Lite 3D Printers comes with a 4K 8.9-inch Monochrome LCD with 3840*2400 resolution. Which means faster printing speed, higher printing efficiency and precision.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-5_480x480.jpg?v=1682597034" style="float: right;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">Efficient Cooling and Filtration</h4>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">System</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">Specially designed dual heat dissipation system, precise and intelligent control to detect and evaporate heat. Activated carbon air filtration can effectively reduce the odor emission and offer you a refreshing printing experience.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> </p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-6_480x480.jpg?v=1682597135" style="float: left;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">Larger Printing Size</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">192*120*200mm molding space to realize your creative potential. More larger model you needed can be printed with this printer.</p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-7_480x480.jpg?v=1682597202" style="float: right;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini" style="text-align: left;">Wifi/APP Remote Control</h4>\n<p style="text-align: left;">Creality Cloud App for mornitor printing progress, adjust the printing settings. Built-in Wifi allows one-click upgrades to the firmware.</p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"> <br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><br></p>\n<p style="text-align: left;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-8_480x480.jpg?v=1682597272" style="float: left;"></p>\n<h4 class="a-spacing-mini">5'' Color Touch Screen</h4>\n<p>5-inch color touch screen with simple visual interface for you to easily control the operation of Halot Lite.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-9_480x480.jpg?v=1682597308" width="548" height="169"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>	70000.00	57000.00	57000.00	0	t	f	f	t	0.00	305	t	[]	[]	[{"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058613-149048164.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058656-520846882.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058606-283798262.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058612-944845930.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060011-33155368.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060171-189999310.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060466-499798035.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060961-217524964.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}, {"url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060935-732378218.jpg", "isPrimary": false, "sortOrder": 0}]	[]	