 sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px"></a><a href="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-3227764 aligncenter" src="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_.jpg" alt="Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer" width="1500" height="1500" title="Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer Bambu Lab" srcset="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_.jpg 1500w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_-300x300.jpg 300w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_-150x150.jpg 150w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_-768x768.jpg 768w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_-462x462.jpg 462w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_-100x100.jpg 100w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61yUBEF5VQL._SL1500_-64x64.jpg 64w" sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px"></a><a href="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/81XAgGu1R6L._SL1500_-1.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-3227765 aligncenter" src="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/81XAgGu1R6L._SL1500_-1.jpg" alt="Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer" width="1500" height="1423" title="Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer Bambu Lab" srcset="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/81XAgGu1R6L._SL1500_-1.jpg 1500w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/81XAgGu1R6L._SL1500_-1-300x285.jpg 300w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/81XAgGu1R6L._SL1500_-1-1024x971.jpg 1024w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/81XAgGu1R6L._SL1500_-1-768x729.jpg 768w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/81XAgGu1R6L._SL1500_-1-462x438.jpg 462w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/81XAgGu1R6L._SL1500_-1-64x61.jpg 64w" sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px"></a></p>	<p><b> </b></p>\n<h4><strong>Features:</strong></h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<strong data-start="76" data-end="99">High-Speed Printing</strong><span> </span>– Prints up to<span> </span><strong data-start="115" data-end="127">250 mm/s</strong>, enabling fast production without sacrificing print quality</li>\n<li>\n<strong data-start="269" data-end="303">multi-color and multi-material</strong><span> </span>printing with zero manual intervention</li>\n<li>\n<strong data-start="347" data-end="373">Improved Motion System</strong><span> </span>–<span> </span><strong data-start="376" data-end="407">High-precision linear rails</strong><span> </span>provide excellent stability and accuracy at high speeds</li>\n<li>\n<strong data-start="468" data-end="497">Advanced Auto Calibration</strong><span> </span>–<span> </span><strong data-start="500" data-end="526">Automatic bed leveling</strong><span> </span>ensures strong first-layer adhesion and hassle-free setup</li>\n<li>\n<strong data-start="589" data-end="628">User-Friendly Touchscreen Interface</strong><span> </span>– Large, intuitive display for easy control, monitoring, and job management</li>\n<li>\n<strong data-start="709" data-end="740">Wide Filament Compatibility</strong><span> </span>– Supports<span> </span><strong data-start="752" data-end="800">PLA, ABS, TPU, PETG, and composite filaments</strong><span> </span>for versatile applications</li>\n<li>\n<strong data-start="832" data-end="860">Efficient Cooling System</strong><span> </span>– Upgraded cooling ensures optimal extrusion control and consistent, high-quality prints</li>\n</ol>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9e9aea0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9e9aea0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<p>Bambu Lab P1S Combo 3D Printer</p>\n<p>The Bambu Lab P1S Combo 3D Printer is a high-performance, plug-and-play 3D printer with an enclosed chamber for stable, high-temperature printing. It features Advanced Waveform Sharing (AWS) for up to 16-color multi-color prints , making it perfect for vibrant, complex designs. With 20,000 mm² acceleration, it delivers fast, accurate prints for both large prototypes and small models. This upgradeable printer is easy to set up, reliable, and ideal for creative and professional 3D printing.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Works right out of the box, set up in 15 minutes</li>\n<li>Well-polished hardware and software</li>\n<li>Enclosed-body for high-temperature filament printing</li>\n<li>Up to 16-color printing with AMS</li>\n<li>Up to 20000 mm/s² acceleration, prints a benchy in 18min</li>\n<li>Build-in camera for remote monitoring and timelapse</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-eec7138 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="eec7138" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">\n<h5 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">All-around performance right out of the box</h5>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e1b4d84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e1b4d84" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<p>Bambu Lab P1S Combo 3D Printer works right out of the box. You don’t have to mess with it, just simply hit print, and the printer will handle all the calibrations (Auto-Bed Leveling, Vibration compensation) for you. Enjoy trouble-free printing every time with your P1S.</p>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-49deac4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="49deac4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">\n<h5 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Multi-color capability</h5>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f0757af elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f0757af" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<p>Get the AMS combo to unleash Multi-color printing capability. (up to 16-color if you stack up 4 AMS units). Purchase <a href="https://global.store.bambulab.com/products/ams-multicolor-printing"><b>additional AMS units</b></a> for more colors.</p>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c4f4804 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c4f4804" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">\n<h5 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Print fast with exceptional quality</h5>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-38953b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="38953b7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<p>Cutting-edge control algorithm with the help of vibration compensation and pressure advance, bringing you lightning-fast print speed without compromising on quality.</p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h4><strong>Package Includes:</strong></h4>\n<p>1 x Bambu Lab P1S with AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer</p>\n<p>1 x Bambu Lab AMS</p>\n<p>2 x Spare Filament Cutter</p>\n<p>1 x Bambu Bus Cable – 6 Pin</p>\n<p>1 x Bambu Bus Cable – 4 Pin</p>\n<p>1 x Bambu PLA Filament</p>\n<p>1 x Bambu PLA Support Filament</p>\n<p>The Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer is a powerful, high-speed 3D printing solution built for creators, engineers, and professionals who demand accuracy and efficiency. Featuring an enclosed P1S printer paired with the advanced AMS 2 Pro automatic material system, it enables seamless multi-material and multi-color printing with minimal manual intervention.</p>\n<p>With blazing-fast print speeds, intelligent vibration compensation, and real-time monitoring via built-in sensors and camera, every print delivers consistent quality. Its wide material compatibility, automatic leveling, and reliable power-loss recovery make it ideal for prototyping, functional parts, and creative production.<a href="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-5-scaled-2.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-3221177" src="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-5-scaled-2.jpg" alt="Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer" width="1056" height="542" title="Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer Bambu Lab" srcset="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-5-scaled-2.jpg 936w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-5-scaled-2-300x154.jpg 300w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-5-scaled-2-768x394.jpg 768w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-5-scaled-2-462x237.jpg 462w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-5-scaled-2-64x33.jpg 64w" sizes="(max-width: 1056px) 100vw, 1056px"></a><a href="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/51CNI2cxDNL._SL1352_.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-3227761 aligncenter" src="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/51CNI2cxDNL._SL1352_.jpg" alt="Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer" width="1352" height="841" title="Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer Bambu Lab" srcset="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/51CNI2cxDNL._SL1352_.jpg 1352w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/51CNI2cxDNL._SL1352_-300x187.jpg 300w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/51CNI2cxDNL._SL1352_-1024x637.jpg 1024w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/51CNI2cxDNL._SL1352_-768x478.jpg 768w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/51CNI2cxDNL._SL1352_-462x287.jpg 462w, https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/51CNI2cxDNL._SL1352_-64x40.jpg 64w" sizes="(max-width: 1352px) 100vw, 1352px"></a><a href="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61OUAlGT48L._SL1500_.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-3227762 aligncenter" src="https://robu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/61OUAlGT48L._SL1500_.jpg" alt="Bambu Lab P1S AMS 2 Pro Combo 3D Printer