iv>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="gridItemContent">\n<div class="small portal-css-1b86ef4">\n<div class="imgContent">\n<div class="imgContent  MuiBox-root portal-css-70l9qz"><picture><source srcset="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/laser-cut.jpg" media="(min-width: 1025px)" data-srcset="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/laser-cut.jpg"><img height="381" width="410" src="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/laser-cut-sm.jpg" alt="" data-src="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/laser-cut-sm.jpg" class="img lazyloaded"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class="imgMediaTextContent">\n<div class="title"> <picture><source srcset="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/Air-Assist.jpg" media="(min-width: 1025px)" data-srcset="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/Air-Assist.jpg"><img height="385" width="414" src="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/Air-Assist-sm.jpg" alt="" data-src="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/Air-Assist-sm.jpg" class="img lazyloaded"></picture><span style="font-size: 0.875rem;">.</span><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="gridItemContent">\n<div class="small portal-css-1b86ef4">\n<div class="imgContent">\n<div class="imgContent  MuiBox-root portal-css-70l9qz"><picture><source srcset="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/Digital-Cutting.jpg" media="(min-width: 1025px)" data-srcset="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/Digital-Cutting.jpg"><img height="392" width="421" src="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/Digital-Cutting-sm.jpg" alt="" data-src="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/Digital-Cutting-sm.jpg" class="img lazyloaded"></picture></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="gridItemContent">\n<div class="portal-css-1b86ef4">\n<div class="imgContent">\n<div class="imgContent  MuiBox-root portal-css-70l9qz"><picture><source srcset="https://portal.bblmw.com/h2s/42w7aphtjhl/Cut/Drawing.jpg" media="(min-width: 1025px)" data-sr